<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">1 Kolɛnte</para>
  <para style="toc1">Pɔle Ná-Sɛʋɛ Mɔungi É Teʋeni Kolɛnte Nuiti Ma</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Kolɛnte</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Ko</para>
  <para style="mt2">Pɔle Ná-Sɛʋɛ Mɔungi <optbreak/> É Teʋeni</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kolɛnte Nuiti Ma</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Sɛʋɛ mɔungi nii teʋegai Kolɛnte nuiti ma, Keelai Pɔle ɠa é sɛʋɛni kona ʋuulɔɔlugɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (55) ɠɛɠala leʋegai ma Yesu zɔlɔɔgai ʋoluma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 1:1">1:1</ref></char>). Tɔ ɠa é ga Pɔle ná-sɛʋɛ felegɔiti ma mɔungi niiti ti ade yea ti leʋegai Kolɛnte Egilisii ma. Tanisu é sɛʋɛi nii zɛʋɛni, siɛgi zu é ɠɛni la Efɛze, aisa é ʋa li la daalimai ma, nii é ɠɛni pɔ é bo Kolɛnte diizuʋɛ Masedoane ta galema ziɛgi zu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 16:5-9">16:5-9</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Sɛʋɛi nii ɠa ga gooɠaaʋotegi é ʋilɛ fai tanigaa ʋa, niiti Pɔle ti zɔlɔɔni Egilisii zu nui tanigaa ya, faa ɲɔi niiti ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu Egilisii zu, naati ti ɠɛni ga zeeɠaaɠwɛɛ vai ta koloɠologi. Kolɛnte taa wolai lɔɠɔɠulani gola, é lo koloɠologi ʋa, tɔ ɠa é ba é la ga kulafiliba vaa ga Kolɛnte Egilisii faa ɓaagiti sɔlɔɔ. Kolɛnte nuiti ta-zɛʋɛ mɔungi zu gaaɠwɛsu ɠila ka su nii tɔɠɔɠulaai, é lo nɛɛbɛi ʋa: gaaɠwɛsu puugɔ maazu saʋagɔi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 13:1-13">13:1-13</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Pɔle ná-tuʋɔ gooi laazeelini Kolɛnte nuiti ma ta é GALA mama ta-vaa zu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 1:1-9">1:1-9</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Naa ʋoluma é tɔɔzei ga naati gaaɠula ba, niiti é ti ma ɠeela wooi zɔlɔɔni, é lo zeeɠaaɠwɛɛ vaiti ba ti Kolɛnte Egilisii zu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 1:10-4:21">1:10—4:21</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Naa ʋoluma é naa ɠaaɠulani ba, nii pilɛgai koloɠolo faiti ba, ta tukpɔ lo faiti ti keletiɛinti zɔɠɔzu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 5:1-6:20">5:1—6:20</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Naa pɛ poluma, é kalagiti feeni, é lo vulu vai ʋa, ta kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti kɔɔ zuaiti, ta GALA dɛbi ʋelei maaɓɔgiti, naa ʋɛɛ zɛnvu zu vebɛaniiti so pelei, ta gɔvɛiti buzeɠe vai ʋa, ti ɠula saai ya (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 7:1-15:58">7:1—15:58</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Gaaɓelasu, é kalagi tanigaa wo, é lo nu luʋa ʋelei tanigaa ʋa ta ɓɔɠɔ vaiti (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 16:1-24">16:1-24</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1"/>
  <para style="s">Tuʋɔ gooiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1"/>Nɛ̀i gè ga Pɔle, tòligai GALA ziimai maaʋele ma, ga gè ɠɛ ga Yesu Kilista ná-keelai, gá ade-ɠɛɛloin Sosɛtɛne, <verse eid="1CO 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2"/>gá wo luʋɔsu, wɔi wo GALA ná-Egilisii zu Kolɛnte taazuʋɛ, wɔi wa-ɠotoiti gbaai wa-ɠilibalai zu wa Yesu Kilista, wo loligai ga wo ɠɛ ga GALA ná-nuiti, wa naati kpein ti mini-o-mini ti wooɠulazu ade-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista ma, ti-Maliɠii, ada ɓalaagi de-Maliɠii. <verse eid="1CO 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3"/>Ade-Ɠɛɛ GALA ta de-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista ti zaalai la wo ma, ti ziilɛigi ve wo ʋɛ.<verse eid="1CO 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle GALA mama fai Kolɛnte nuiti ta-vaa zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4"/>Nà mamagi veezu GALA bɛ yeenɔpɛ wa-vaa zu, tɔɔzei zaalai ʋa, é daa wo ma ga Yesu Kilista maaʋele. <verse eid="1CO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ é wo laazeeliʋɛ, é ʋooʋa ma, fai pɛ su Kilista zaɓui zu, kpɔɛzuɠulai zu, faaɠwɛgi zu. <verse eid="1CO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6"/>Zeele wooi é wosu Kilista ná-faa zu, naa ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛʋɛ wo zaama ga pagɔ. <verse eid="1CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7"/>Naazu, wo la ʋalani GALA ná-vebɛanii tanɔpɛ ma, wɔiti wo ade-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista ná-kulakɛlɛma yeei maaɓɔunsu. <verse eid="1CO 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8"/>Toɠa wo makɛ, wo lo kpaan eyɛsu gaaɓela foloi zeeli, nii a kɛ peelalazu nɔpɛ ge mina ɠɛ wo ʋa, de-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista ná-foloi zu. <verse eid="1CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9"/>GALA ka ga wooɠɛɠila nu ná-minazeɠegiti su, GALAGI é wo loliga ga wo ɠɛ kpɔfaamai zu wa ná-Doun Zunui Yesu Kilista, ade-Maliɠii.<verse eid="1CO 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zeeɠaaɠwɛɛ vai Kolɛnte Egilisii zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, nà wo maanɛɛnɛzu ade-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista laaseigi maaʋele ma, wo pɛ à zoloo woo ɠila ma, zeeɠaaɠwɛɛ vaa mina ɠɛ wo zaama. À ɠili ʋa kpaan, wa-ɠisiɛi ta wo ɠisu vai ɠɛ ga ani ɠilagi. <verse eid="1CO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11"/>Mazɔlɔɔ, kɛ̀ɛleaiti, Kolowe ná-pɛlɛwu nuiti ti bogɛ mà ga sakpegiti ta wo zaama. <verse eid="1CO 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12"/>Nii gè pɔ gè bo, toɠa ga nii: Wo ɠilagilagi ɠa bosu, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Nɔ̀un, nà ga Pɔle ʋolu nu,» ɓaa «Nɔ̀un, nà ga Apolɔse ʋolu nu,» ɓaa «Nɔ̀un, nà ga Piyɛlɛ ʋolu nu,» ɓaa «Nɔ̀un, nà ga Kilista ʋolu nu.» <verse eid="1CO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13"/>Wa ɠisiɛzu ga Kilista ɠaaɠwɛɛʋɛ su ɓaa? Pɔle ɠa é ɓadɔni saa wului ma wa-vaa zu ɓaa? Wo ɓatizeni Pɔle laaseigi zu ɓaa?<verse eid="1CO 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14"/>Nà GALA mamasu, ga gè la wo tanɔpɛ kpatizeni, kɛni Kilisepuse ta Gaiyuseni nɔ, <verse eid="1CO 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15"/>naa ɠa a kɛ nu nɔpɛ ge mina ɠɛ, é ɓatizeni dàaseigi zu. <verse eid="1CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16"/>Ungo, gaama ʋe! Gè Setefanase ná-pɛlɛwu nuiti kpatizeni ɓalaa. Naa ʋoluma, gè la kwɛɛ, ni gè taɠiligaa ɓatizeni mɔnɔ. <verse eid="1CO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17"/>Kilista la ɠɛni tèʋeni ɓatize vaa ma, kɛni Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli vai, naa mina ɠɛ ga nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠimalai ma ɓɔɛzuɠulai maaʋele, naa ɠa a kɛ Kilista zaa vai saa wului ma, naa mina ɠɛ ga wafuun faa.<verse eid="1CO 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Kilista ɠa é ga GALA ná-zɛbɛi ta ná-ɠimalai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18"/>Tɛnɛgi é wosu é lo Kilista zaa vai ʋa saa wului ma, naa ɠa ga ɠimalala vaa naati gaazu, niiti ti undaaʋilisu, kɛlɛ dɛiti de kizo pelei ma, toɠa de ʋɛ ga GALA ná-zɛbɛi. <verse eid="1CO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19"/>Mazɔlɔɔ sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">«Nà ɠima nuiti ta-ɠimalai ɠoloɠolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 1:19">nà keleɠele nuiti ta-ɠeleɠelegi ɠɛ ga faa ɲaka.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 29:14">Eza 29:14</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="1CO 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20"/>Mini ɠa ɠima nui ná? Mini ɠa tɔ kalamɔin ná? Mini ɠa niima eteai zu daaɠɔlɔ nui ná? GALA ge la niima eteai zu ɠima vai ɠɛɛni ga ɠimalala vaa ɓaa?<verse eid="1CO 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21"/>Tama, GALA ge deveni ná-ɠimalai zu ga eteai la zooga é ʋa tɔun kwɛɛ nui ná-ɠimalai zaɓui zu. Naa ɠa é ba, GALA ge deveni ga pagɛ ga é naati kizo, zɔiti ti ɠidaaleʋeai ga wooi naa maaʋele nii gi daazeelizu, nuiti ti kaazu ga ɠimalala ɓɔɛi ʋe. <verse eid="1CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22"/>Zuifuiti ta laavɔɔ vaiti maaɠaazaɠabosu, Gɛlɛkiiti ti ɗa ɠimalai ɠaiziɛ. <verse eid="1CO 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23"/>Giya ma, Kilista ɓadɔ vai saa wului ma, gá naama wooi laazeelizu, naa ɠa Zuifuiti bɛ ga kɔɠɔziɠa zaɓu, é ɠɛ ga ɠimalala vaa zii ɠiligiti bɛ, <verse eid="1CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24"/>kɛlɛ niiti GALA ge ti loligai, Zuifuiti ta zii ɠiligiti, Kilista ɠa ga GALA ná-zɛbɛi ta GALA ná-ɠimalai naati bɛ. <verse eid="1CO 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nii é nu ɠaazu ga GALA ná-ɠimalalai, naama ɠimalai wɔɔlɔʋɛ, é leʋe nuiti ta-ɠimalai ʋa, ta nii é nu ɠaazu ga GALA ná-zɛbɛsulalai, naa zɛbɛi wɔɔlɔʋɛ, é leʋe nuiti ta-zɛbɛsulai ʋa.<verse eid="1CO 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, à ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛʋele ʋɛtɛ dɛɛ: Wo ɠɛni ga ɓɛgele, wɔiti GALA ge wo loligai ga wo ʋa pɔ? Eteai letemazu, ɠima nui la mɔinni wo zaama, ɓaa zobobɛ nuiti, ɓaa seizumaanɛgiti. <verse eid="1CO 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27"/>Kɛlɛ GALA ge yiimazeɠea ga naama aniiti, niiti eteai ti levezu ga ɠimalala aniiti, é ʋa ɠima geleiti unfe ga tiye. É yiimazeɠea ga zɛbɛsulala aniiti, é ʋa zɛbɛsu geleiti unfe ga tiye. <verse eid="1CO 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28"/>GALA ge yiimazeɠeʋɛ ga naa, nii eteai devezu ga tosu la ba, ti ɓaaɠulazu ma, é la ɠaazu ga ani nɔpɛ, nii a kɛ é naati gaaʋala ba, niiti ti levezu ga ani ɓiigiti, <verse eid="1CO 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29"/>naa ɠa a kɛ, nuɓusɛi tanɔpɛ ge mina ɓɔɠɔ maamusɛ GALA gaazu. <verse eid="1CO 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30"/>Kɛlɛ GALA ge wo ɠiliʋɛ Yesu Kilista ʋa, é Kilista ɠɛ ga da-ɠimalai. Kilista maaʋele ma de ɠɛa ga telebo nuiti GALA gaazu, ta nu ɲadegaiti, de unmɔɔgi zɔlɔɔga da-ɠotoiti ma. <verse eid="1CO 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31"/>Naa ɠa é ba, eɠɛʋelei sɛʋɛai la GALA Sɛʋɛi zu: «Zɔi é pɔ ga é ɓɔɠɔ maamusɛ, é ɓɔɠɔ maamusɛ Maliɠii ɠɛɛ vaiti su.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 9:23">Zel 9:23</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="1CO 1:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2"/>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ná-tɛnɛgi é boni Kolɛnte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, siɛgi zu gè liini la wo ʋɔ bɛ, ga gè GALA ná-faazeikpasui ma lɔɔɠuzu vaiti daazeeli wo ma, gè la ɠɛni woo woni wo ma, nii gaaɠaazu ɓaai, ɓaa ɠima ɓɔɛ maayikiai. <verse eid="1CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2"/>Mazɔlɔɔ gè deveni ga gè mina ani ɠili nɔpɛ kwɛɛ, yeeɠɛɠalai zu gè kɛɛzu wo zaama, kɛni Yesu Kilista, Yesu Kilista nii é ɓadɔni saa wului ma. <verse eid="1CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3"/>Naa ɠa é ba, gè ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛni ga woye ga zɛbɛ la bà, gè ɠɛ duai ta sasuɓali wolai zu. <verse eid="1CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4"/>Nà-kalagi ta nà-tɛnɛgiti ti la ɠɛni wosu ga nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠeleɠelegi ma ɠimalai, kɛni Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ná-zɛbɛi ma ɠulakɛlɛmai lɛɛ vai, <verse eid="1CO 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5"/>naa ɠa a kɛ wa-ɠidaaleʋei mina zɛlɛ nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠimalai ʋa, kɛni GALA ná-zɛbɛi.<verse eid="1CO 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA ná-ɠimalai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, ɠimala ɓɔɛi ɠa gi daazeelizu naati ma, niiti ti ga nu ɠiteiti kidaaleʋei zu. É la ga nii eteai devezu ga ɠimalai, ɓaa niima eteai zu ɠundiɠiiti ta-ɠimalai, niiti ti ʋaazu ɲɛɛlɛzu. <verse eid="1CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7"/>Gá GALA ná-ɠimalai laazeelizu, nii é ɠɛni dɔɔɠui zu eyɛsu za. GALA ge kpɛtɛni ɠana kaite aisa wɔlɔwɔlɔi, é ʋa ɠɛ ga lɛbiyai ade ma vaa ma. <verse eid="1CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8"/>Eteai niizu ɠundiɠiiti taɠila kpalaa ge la ɠɛni naama ɠimalai ɠwɛɛ. Mazɔlɔɔ ni ti ɠɛni kwɛɛ, ti la ɓena lɛbiya Maliɠii ɓadɔ saa wului ma. <verse eid="1CO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9"/>Kɛlɛ sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">«Nii nu nɔpɛ gaazu la dɛ kaani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">nii nu woiyeɠe la dɛ mɛnini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">nuɓusɛ la dɛ ɠigaiziɛni su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:9">naa ɠa GALA ge kpɛtɛai naati bɛ, niiti ti nɛai ʋɛ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 64:3">Eza 64:3</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="1CO 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10"/>Tama, ada ɠa GALA ge dɔɔɠuzu vai naa ɠulaai kɛlɛma ade ʋɛ ga ná-Zɛnvui maaʋele. Tɔɔzei Zɛnvui ɠa fai pɛ fɛɠɛlɛfɛɠɛlɛsu, anɛɛ GALA ná-faazeikpasui niiti ti lɔɔɠuai gola. <verse eid="1CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11"/>Nu ɓɔɠɔ yɛnvui nɔ ɠa é ɠigi zu vai ɠwɛɛ. Zekana é la, GALA Zɛnvui nɔ ɠa é GALA kigi zu vai ɠwɛɛ.<verse eid="1CO 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12"/>Gá ma, gi la eteai ná-zɛnvui zɔlɔɔni, kɛni Zɛnvui ɓɔɠɔi nii seɠeai GALA pɔ bɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ gi faanɛɛi kpein kwɛɛ, nii GALA ge kɛa gi ʋɛ. <verse eid="1CO 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13"/>Gi la naama ɓɔɛiti bosu eɠɛʋelei nui ná-ɠimala ɓɔɛi ma ɠalagi la, kɛlɛ kɛni niiti GALA Zɛnvui kalagi wosu da. Zekana gi zɛnvu zu ɠaama vaiti zɔɠɔzuɠulazu la ga zɛnvu zu ɓɔɛiti.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ga zɛnvu zu ɓɔɛiti</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">naama nuiti ma, niiti ti Zɛnvui ɠwɛɛ</char></note><verse eid="1CO 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14"/>Kɛlɛ nui nii GALA Zɛnvui la ziimaʋɛ, é la zooga é ʋa yeezei Zɛnvui tɔna ná-gaama vaiti bu, mazɔlɔɔ naati ta tɔun gaazu ga ɠimalala vaa nɔ. É la zooga é ʋa ti ɠaaɠa, tɔɔzei GALA Zɛnvui nɔ ɠa é ma zobogi veezu pɛ, nu ʋa ti yɔɠɔzuɠwɛɛ. <verse eid="1CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15"/>Nui GALA Zɛnvui ziimaʋɛ, naa ɠa zoo é fai pɛ ma lukpɔi ɠaaleʋe, kɛlɛ nu nɔpɛ ge la zooga é ʋa tɔun tukpɔɠaaleʋe. <verse eid="1CO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16"/>Mazɔlɔɔ GALA Sɛʋɛi bogɛ, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">«Ɓɛ ɠa é Maliɠii ná-kisiɛi ɠwɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 2:16">ɓɛ ɠa a zoo é tɔun kala?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Eza 40:13</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Tama adɔun, Kilista ná-kisiɛi ɠa é de ya.<verse eid="1CO 2:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ná-botiɠɛ nuiti tosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1"/>Nɔ̀un nà, kɛ̀ɛleaiti, gè la ɠɛni zooni gè ʋa ɓɔɛ wo ʋɔ eɠɛ nuiti GALA Zɛnvui loni ti luɠɔ, gè ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu wo ʋɔ eɠɛ etea nuɓusɛiti nɔ, eɠɛ doungoiti kidaaleʋei zu Kilista ma. <verse eid="1CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2"/>Gè ɲiimiɗɛi nɔ veeni wo ya, daamiani kpaaɓaa ge la ɠɛni de, mazɔlɔɔ wo la ɓena ziɛ bu. Anɛɛ niizuʋɛ, wo la dɛ ziaa bu, <verse eid="1CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3"/>tɔɔzei wa dɛ ziɛzu nɔ ga etea nuɓusɛiti siɛ ʋelei. Tama tɛi tolo ɲɔi wo zaama, ta kpɔɛ vaiti, wo la ziɛzu ga etea nuɓusɛiti kɛʋele ɓaa? <verse eid="1CO 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4"/>Siɛgi zu wo taɠila ge ɠɛɛzu ma la: «Nà ga Pɔle ʋolu nu,» zɔi ɠɛ ma: «Nà ga Apolɔse ʋolu nu,» nuɓusɛiti tuʋa ʋelei la ga naa ɓaa, wo ʋa ɠɛ ziɛzu la?<verse eid="1CO 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5"/>Ɓɛ ɠa mu é ga Apolɔse? Ɓɛ ɠa é ga Pɔle? Botiɠɛ nuiti nɔ, niiti wo ɠidaaleʋeai nɔ ti ya, eɠɛʋelei Maliɠii ma zobogi vea la ɛsɛ zea. <verse eid="1CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6"/>Gè siinni, Apolɔse kɔ ga ziɛi, kɛlɛ GALA ka é kpɛtɛni. <verse eid="1CO 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7"/>Naa ma, zɔi é siinsu, ta zɔi é kɔɔzu ga ziɛi, naati ti la ga ani nɔpɛ, kɛni GALA, nii é kpɛtɛzu. <verse eid="1CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8"/>Zɔi é siinsu, ta zɔi é kɔɔzu ga ziɛi, ta ga ɠɛʋele nɔ, GALA ka ti ɠilagilagi zala, é zoloo ta-wotiiti ma, ta kɛ. <verse eid="1CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9"/>Mazɔlɔɔ gá botii ɠɛɛzu ʋɔɔma GALA ná-fai zu, wa ga GALA ná-kpalagi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 3:9">Wa ɓalaa wa ga GALA ná-pɛlɛi. <verse eid="1CO 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10"/>Eɠɛʋelei GALA ge tèʋegai la wo ma ná-zaalai zu, gè seɓasemai laa, eɠɛʋelei ɠima ʋɛlɛ lo nui a ɗa kɛ la. Niizu, nu ɠili ka ta lo maazu. Kɛlɛ ɛsɛ ge dama ga ma ʋɛlɛi lo pelei maazu. <verse eid="1CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nu nɔpɛ ge la zooga é ʋa seɓasema ɠili da mɔnɔ, zɔi ʋolu daai, nii é ga Yesu Kilista. <verse eid="1CO 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12"/>Nui ta ɠa zoo é to seɓasemai naa maazu ga zanugi, ɓaa walii, ɓaa kɔtu zɔngɔ ɓaagiti, ɓaa gului, ɓaa tufa vɔɔi, ɓaa muiin. <verse eid="1CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13"/>Kɛlɛ ɛsɛ ná-kɛɛwotii ma zii ɠa ɠula kɛlɛ zu tukpɔɠaaleʋe voloi, tɔɔzei toɠa ɠula kɛlɛ zu abui ɠa, abui ɠa ɛsɛ gilagilagi ná-kɛɛwotii zuɠɔɠɔ. <verse eid="1CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14"/>Ni nui ta ná-kɛɛwotii é togai seɓasemai naa ɠa, naa la ɠɛ ɠalani abui ɠa, naama nui ɠa zalai zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="1CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15"/>Kɛlɛ zɔi ná-kɛɛwotii a ɠalana, toɠa ʋala salai ma, kɛlɛ tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ɠa ɠizo, eɠɛ a leʋe abui zaama.<verse eid="1CO 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16"/>Wo la suɠwɛɛ ɓaa ga wa ga GALA sei ʋɛlɛi, ga GALA Zɛnvui ɠa zeini wo-yiimaʋɛ? <verse eid="1CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17"/>Ni nu a GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ɠoloɠolona, GALA ka naama nui ɠoloɠolo. Mazɔlɔɔ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ɲadegɛ, wa ɠa wo ga naama ʋɛlɛi.<verse eid="1CO 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18"/>Nu nɔpɛ ge mina ɓɔɠɔ yaava. Ni nui ta ɠa wo zaama, é ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazu ga ɠima nu eteai ná-kɛʋelei ma, é ɠɛ ga ɠimalala nu, naa ɠa a kɛ é ɠɛ ga ɠima nui. <verse eid="1CO 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19"/>Mazɔlɔɔ niima eteai ná-ɠimalai ɠa ga ɠimalala vaa GALA gaazu. Mazɔlɔɔ sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 3:19">«Toɠa ɗa ɠima nuiti so ga balii, nii é ga ta-ɠeleɠele ɲɔi.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 5:13">Zɔɓ 5:13</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="1CO 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20"/>Sɛʋɛʋɛ mɔnɔ ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 3:20">«Maliɠii ɠima nuiti ta-ɠisiɛiti kwɛɛ, ta nɔ ga faa ɲaka.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 94:11">Guy 94:11</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="1CO 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nu nɔpɛ ge mina ɓɔɠɔ lɛ su ga nuɓusɛ vaa. Mazɔlɔɔ ti pɛ ta ga wɔnɔ, <verse eid="1CO 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22"/>é ɠɛni ga Pɔle ʋe, ɓaa Apolɔse ʋe, ɓaa Piyɛlɛ ʋe, ɓaa eteai ʋe, ɓaa nu yɛnvui ʋe, ɓaa saai ʋe, ɓaa niizu vaiti be, ɓaa faiti be ti ʋaazu. Ti pɛ ta ga wɔnɔ, <verse eid="1CO 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23"/>kɛlɛ wɔun, wa ga Kilista nɔnɔiti, Kilista ɠɛ ga GALA nɔnɔ.<verse eid="1CO 3:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4"/>
  <para style="s">Kilista ná-keelaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1"/>Wo maanɛɛʋɛ, wo gi leve ga Kilista ná-botiɠɛ nuiti, ta nuiti GALA ná-fai ma lɔɔɠuzu vaiti kalivaai ti ma. <verse eid="1CO 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2"/>Nii ɛsɛ pɛ ge pɔ kaliva ma makɛ nuiti ta-vaa zu, naa ɠa é ga, ti ɠɛ ga wooɠɛɠila nuiti. <verse eid="1CO 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3"/>Nɔ̀un nà, gè la yiizoolɛzu ga wo tùkpɔɠaaleʋe vai, ɓaa eteai tùkpɔɠaaleʋe vai. Gè la ɓɔɠɔ lukpɔɠaaleʋezu ɓalaa, nà ɓɔɠɔi. <verse eid="1CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4"/>Anɛɛ ni gè la ɓɔɠɔ ʋeelalazu kìgi zu, naa la bosu ga nà pee zɔlɔɔ naa zu. Zɔi é tùkpɔɠaaleʋezu, tɔ ɠa é ga Maliɠii. <verse eid="1CO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5"/>Naa ɠa é ba, à mina faa nɔpɛ ma lukpɔ ɠaaleʋe ma yeeluɠɔ, eyɛsu Maliɠii ʋa. Toɠa kpidii zu lɔɔɠuzu vaiti kula kɛlɛma, é nuiti ziimaʋɛ vaiti dɛɛ. Názu ɠa ɛsɛ ka maamusɛi zɔlɔɔ da GALA zea.<verse eid="1CO 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, nii gè boga, gè pokɔɠɔga gi ma gá Apolɔse, é ɠɛ wo ʋɛ ga kalagi. Wa gaaɠa ɓalaa ga gá-ʋoogi maaʋele, ga wo mina ɓudɛ naa maazu, nii sɛʋɛai, wo tanɔpɛ ge mina waso, é ʋa lo nu ʋolu, nu laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="1CO 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɓɛ ɠa é è vizɔ ga zɔiti ba? Leeni ɠa é è ya, nii GALA ge la feeni è ya? Ni tama fea nɔ ʋe è ya, ɗa wasosu ɠale, eɠɛ é la veeni nɔ è ya?<verse eid="1CO 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8"/>Wo wo wɔinma anii pɛ sɔlɔɔgɛ na! Wo ɓɛtɛʋɛ na! Wo ɠɛa ga masagiti, tama gi la ga masagaa! Nà pɔ ga wo masa fai ɠɛ ga ɠite, naa ɠa a kɛ gi masa fai ɠɛ wo ʋa! <verse eid="1CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nà ɠisiɛzu ga GALA ge gi zeiɗa, gɛi gi ga keelaiti, gi ɠɛ ga nuiti ma ɠaaɓelagiti, gi ɠɛ eɠɛ nuiti deveai ti ma ga ti za kɛlɛi zu, gi ɠɛa ga pɛtɛ ganii eteai pɛ bɛ: geezuɠeelaiti bɛ, ta nuɓusɛiti pɛ bɛ. <verse eid="1CO 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10"/>Gá ga ɠimalala nuiti Kilista ná-faa zu, kɛlɛ wɔun, wa ga ɠima nuiti wa-ɠilibalai zu wa Kilista. Zɛbɛ la gi ʋa, kɛlɛ wɔun, wo zuɓaaʋɛ. Lɛbiyai ɠa wo ʋɛ, kɛlɛ gɔun, ɓaaɠulaʋɛ gi ma! <verse eid="1CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11"/>Zaaɠaza, gi maa ɠa nɔɠɔzu ga pului, ta kpɔɔle wɔin, ta seɠe vɛɛloi, gá doɠai laawu, gi ɠɛ ga teʋeteʋe nuiti, <verse eid="1CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12"/>gá ɓɔlɔzu ga botii ɠɛa ga gi-yeeiti. Ta gi ʋoomuna, gi tuya loo. Ta gi wɔinzeɠena, gi ziɛ naa wu. <verse eid="1CO 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13"/>Siɛgi zu ti gi-lɔɠɔi ɠoloɠolosu da, gá ɗa ɓɔɛ ga pagɔ. Ta gi levezu ga eteai ma nɔɠɔi, anii pɛ ma ɠaʋai, eyɛsu niizu.<verse eid="1CO 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14"/>Wo unfe faa laade gè ʋa ɠɛ niima vaiti sɛʋɛzu la wo ma, kɛlɛ gè wo ɠala, eɠɛʋelei wo la ga dòinti, wo nɛai bɛ̀. <verse eid="1CO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15"/>Anɛɛ ni kalamɔn waapuugɔ (10.000) ɠa wo ya Kilista ná-fai zu, wo-ɠɛɛ ɠa ɠila kpe nɔ, tɔɔzei nà ɠa gè wo zɔlɔɔga kidaaleʋei zu, Yesu Kilista ná-fai zu, ga Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli vai maaʋele. <verse eid="1CO 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16"/>Nà wo maanɛɛnɛzu deɠɛmu ga wo ʋokɔɠɔ mà. <verse eid="1CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17"/>Naa ɠa é kɛɛni, gè Timɔte leʋeni wo ma, dòin nii nɛai bɛ̀ gola, é ga wooɠɛɠila nu Maliɠii ná-fai zu. Toɠa wo ɠitoo naati su, ʋelei gè nà-eteai ziɛzu la Kilista ná-fai zu, ʋelei gè ma ɠalagi wosu da adaʋɛ pɛ, Egilisiiti su.<verse eid="1CO 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18"/>Wo zaama, tanigaani ti ɠɛni wasosu, ti ɗa ɠisiɛ ga gè la mɔ ʋa wo ʋɔ bɛ. <verse eid="1CO 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19"/>Kɛlɛ ni Maliɠii a laana ga, su la ɠoozazu gè ʋa wo ʋɔ bɛ. Názu waso nuiti ta-ɓɔɛzuɠulai laade gè ʋa ɠɛ kaazu, kɛlɛ kɛni ti-zɛbɛi! <verse eid="1CO 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20"/>Mazɔlɔɔ GALA ná-masadai la ga kpɔɛzuɠulai nɔ, kɛni zɛbɛi. <verse eid="1CO 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21"/>Leeni ɠa wo pɔ? Gè ʋa wo ʋɔ bɛ ga tukpɔi, ɓaa nɛɛbɛi ta sɛsɛbogi?<verse eid="1CO 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5"/>
  <para style="s">Kpusɛ zu vaiti ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu Egilisii zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1"/>Toɠa wosu adaʋɛ pɛ ga koloɠologi ɠa wo zaama, koloɠologi nii nui niiti vɔlɔ ti la GALA kwɛɛ, ti la ma zii ɠɛɛzu, ga wo taɠila ge ʋilɛga kɛɛɠɛ anzai ʋolu! <verse eid="1CO 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2"/>Wasogi ɠa wo su gola! Wo pɛ wo maanɛɛni wo yiiɓɔlɔ, naa ɠa a la kɛ zunui é naama vai ɠɛai, é ɠula wo zaama! <verse eid="1CO 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3"/>Nɔ̀un nà, anɛɛ ni màaɠoozaʋɛ wo ʋa kpusɛi zu, nà wo ɠoba kisiɛi zu. Tama gè nui naa lukpɔɠaaleʋea Maliɠii Yesu laaseigi zu, eɠɛ nà ɠɛ ná. <verse eid="1CO 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4"/>Wa ɠaalɛɛna ba, nà wo ɠoba kisiɛi zu. Maliɠii Yesu ná-zɛbɛi zu, <verse eid="1CO 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5"/>à naama zunui ve Setana ya, nii a kɛ kpusɛi ɠoloɠolo, nii a kɛ zɛnvui ɠizo Maliɠii ná-foloi zu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nii a kɛ kpusɛi ɠoloɠolo, nii a kɛ zɛnvui ɠizo Maliɠii ná-foloi zu</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nii a kɛ faa ɲɔi nii é ziimaʋɛ, naa ɠoloɠolo, nii a kɛ é ɠizo Maliɠii ná-foloi zu</char></note><verse eid="1CO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6"/>Wa-ɓɔɠɔwɔɔlɔi la ʋani. Wo la kwɛni ɓaa, ga: «lɛʋɛi tago nɔ ɠa a ɗa ɓulu vukɔ ɠaayɔgai pɛ kpokolo»? <verse eid="1CO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7"/>À lɛʋɛ wɔlɔmaiti kpein kula ɓɔɠɔ zaama, naa ɠa a kɛ wo ɠɛ ga ɓulu vukɔ ɠaayɔga niinɛi. Gaamazu, lɛʋɛ la wo ʋa, mazɔlɔɔ ada-Ʋakegi ma ʋaala ziʋoi ɠulani ga zalaɠai, Kilista ɓɔɠɔi ɠa é ga naa. <verse eid="1CO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8"/>Naa ɠa é ba, ade mina da-vɛtii naa ɠula ga lɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai, é mina ɠɛ ga keleɠele ɲɔi ta suɲɔi ma lɛʋɛi, kɛlɛ kɛni é ɠɛ ga ɓului lɛʋɛ la su, nii é ga ɲadegi ta gaamai.<verse eid="1CO 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9"/>Gè sɛʋɛni nà-sɛʋɛi zu, gè teʋe wo ma, ga kpɔfaama mina ɠɛ wo yɔɠɔzu, wa koloɠolo nuiti. <verse eid="1CO 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10"/>Naa la bosu ga kpɔfaama mina ɠɛ wo yɔɠɔzu ɲɛgɛlɛin, wa naati kpein ti eteai zu ga koloɠolo nuiti, ta koozu yii nuiti, ta unma nuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɔɔɠɔ gani kɔɔ nuiti ba. Ni naa ʋe, kɛni wo ɠula eteai zu. <verse eid="1CO 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11"/>Ɓa. Nii gè pɔ gè bo, naa ɠa ga, kpɔfaama mina ɠɛ wo yɔɠɔzu wa nui naa, nii é ɠɛɛzu, toɠa ga kidaaleʋe nui ta, ni a ɠɛna ga koloɠolo nui, ɓaa koozu yii nui, ɓaa kɔɔɠɔ gani kɔɔ nui, ɓaa tɔɠɔ ɠoloɠolo nui, ɓaa nui dɔɔi koloɠologai, ɓaa unma nui. Wo maa la nɛɛni, wo ʋa anɛɛ daami wo ʋɔɔma wa naama nu zii. <verse eid="1CO 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12"/>Nà ɠa nɛi màanɛai, gè naati tukpɔɠaaleʋe, niiti ti la ga kidaaleʋe nua ɓaa? Zɔiti ti wo zaama, naati tɛi wo ʋa ɠɛ ga ta-lukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti ɓaa? <verse eid="1CO 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13"/>Zɔiti ti la ga GALA pɛlɛ wu nui ta, GALA ka naati tukpɔɠaaleʋezu. «À nu ɲɔi ɓɛ, wo kula ɓɔɠɔ zaama.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 17:7">TSV 17:7</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="1CO 5:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6"/>
  <para style="s">Keletiɛinti zɔɠɔzu lukpɔɠaaleʋe vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1"/>Ni kpɔɛ ɠa wo ta yɔɠɔzu ta kɛɛɠɛloin, toɠa zoo ɠale, é lii la tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti pɔ bɛ, ti la luazu GALA ba, é la lia la GALA ná-nuiti pɔ bɛ? <verse eid="1CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2"/>Wo la suɠwɛɛ ɓaa, ga GALA ná-nuiti ka ti ʋaazu eteai lukpɔɠaaleʋezu? Ni tama wa ɠa wo maanɛai ga wo eteai lukpɔɠaaleʋe, wo la zooga wo ʋa faa goiti ma lukpɔi ɠaaleʋe ɓaa? <verse eid="1CO 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3"/>Wo la suɠwɛɛ ɓaa, ga ada geezuɠeelaiti tukpɔɠaaleʋezu? Faa ɓɛgele ɠa mu é eteai zu, nii de la zooga ma lukpɔi ɠaaleʋezu? <verse eid="1CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4"/>Tama, siɛgi zu tukpɔɠaaleʋe vai ta wo zaama la, ga niima eteai zu vai ta, zɔiti ti la levezu ga ani nɔpɛ Egilisii zu, naati ka wo ti zeɠezu ga tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti! <verse eid="1CO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5"/>Nà nii wosu wo unfe fai ma. Ɠima nu ɠila kpalaa ge la wo zaama mu ɓaa, nii a zoo é ɠɛɛɠɛlointi ta-vaawogi wo! <verse eid="1CO 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6"/>Kɛlɛ ɠɛɛɠɛloin ɗa kɛɛɠɛloin lukpɔ, naa ɗa ɠɛ kidaaleʋelala lukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti gaazu!<verse eid="1CO 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7"/>Toobu mu ka niina é wo zaama, ga wo ɓɔɠɔ lukpɔ vai. Leeni vaa zu wo la yiilɔɔzu telebotala vai tanigaani bu? Leeni vaa zu wo la laazu ga ti ʋa la loo wo ma? <verse eid="1CO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8"/>Kɛlɛ tɔun, wa ɠa wo telebotala vai ɠɛɛzu, wo ɗa toomai ɠɛ, wo ɗa naa ɠɛ ɠana ga wo-ɠɛɛlointi! <verse eid="1CO 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9"/>Wo la suɠwɛɛ ɓaa, ga telebotala nuiti ti la GALA ná-masadai zɔlɔɔga ga tɔnɔ? À mina ɓɔɠɔ yaava, koloɠolo nuiti ti la GALA ná-masadai zɔlɔɔga ga tɔnɔ, ta kɔɔɠɔ gani kɔɔ nuiti, naa ʋɛɛ wɛɛnziɛ nuiti ba, ta zunuiti ti laazu ga ɓɔɠɔ, <verse eid="1CO 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10"/>naa ʋɛɛ unma nuiti, ta koozu yii nuiti ba, naa ʋɛɛ nuiti ba ti ɓɔɠɔ veai dɔɔ ya, ta tɔɠɔ ɠoloɠolo nuiti, é ʋɛɛ ladalala nuiti ba. Ti pɛ ti la GALA ná-masadai zɔlɔɔga ga tɔnɔ. <verse eid="1CO 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11"/>Zekana wo tanigaani wo ɠɛni la. Kɛlɛ wo gbani, wo makɛ yɛ GALA bɛ, wo ɠɛ ga telebo nuiti GALA gaazu ga da-ƓALAGI ná-Zɛnvui maaʋele, Maliɠii Yesu Kilista laaseigi zu.<verse eid="1CO 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">À wo-ɓusɛi zo ga pagɔ, é ɠɛ ga lɛbiya GALA bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12"/>«Zobo feeʋɛ bɛ̀ ga gè fai ma zii pɛ kɛ,» kɛlɛ kulanuma la fai pɛ ba. «Zobo feeʋɛ bɛ̀ ga gè fai ma zii pɛ kɛ,» kɛlɛ gè la ɓɔɠɔ vea faa nɔpɛ zea, é ʋa zei ùnda. <verse eid="1CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13"/>«Daamianigi ɠa ná nu ɠogi vaa ma, nu ɠogi ɠa ná daamianigi vaa ma.» GALA ka ti zeizu felegɔ pɛ koloɠolo. Nui ɓusɛi la ga koloɠologi nɔnɔ. Toɠa ga Maliɠii nɔnɔ, Maliɠii ɠa ga kpusɛi nɔnɔ. <verse eid="1CO 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14"/>GALA nii é Maliɠii wuzeɠeni, é kula saai ya, toɠa de wuzeɠe ɓalaa, é de ɠula saai ya ga ná-zɛbɛi maaʋele. <verse eid="1CO 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15"/>Wo la kwɛɛ ɓaa, ga wo-ɓusɛiti ta ga Kilista ɓusɛi ʋaalobazuʋɛti? Gè Kilista ɓusɛi ʋaalobazuʋɛ ta zeɠena, gè kɛ ga koloɠolo anzanui ɓusɛi ʋaalobazuʋɛ ta? Naa li poun! <verse eid="1CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16"/>Wo la kwɛɛ ɓaa, ga zɔi é ɠilizu koloɠolo anzanui ʋa, ta naa ta ga kpusɛ ɠila? Mazɔlɔɔ sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 6:16">«Ti felegɔ ta ɠɛ ga kpusɛ ɠila.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Zen 2:24</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="1CO 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17"/>Kɛlɛ nui é ɠilizu Maliɠii ʋa, ta naa ta ga zɛnvu ɠila. <verse eid="1CO 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18"/>À ɓizɛ koloɠologi ʋa! Zɔɔma ɠotoiti nui ti ɠɛɛzu, naati ta kpusɛi ʋoluʋelei, kɛlɛ zɔi é ɓɔɠɔ veezu koloɠologi ya, toɠa kotoi ɠɛɛzu ɓɔɠɔ ɓusɛi laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="1CO 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19"/>Wo la kwɛɛ ɓaa, ga wo-ɓusɛi ɠa ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai zei ʋɛlɛi, nii é wo-yiimaʋɛ, wo sɔlɔɔgai GALA zea? Wo la ga ɓɔɠɔ nɔnɔ. <verse eid="1CO 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20"/>Mazɔlɔɔ wo unmɔɔgɛ ga sɔngɔ ɓaa. Deɠɛmu à GALA dɛbi ga wo-ɓusɛi.<verse eid="1CO 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7"/>
  <para style="s">Vulu vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1"/>Ade naati pɛtɛna, faiti wo ti-ma zɛʋɛi ɠɛai mà. Pagɛ zunui ma ga é mina anzanu vulu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pagɛ zunui ma ga é mina anzanu vulu</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Wo ɠɛni ma: «Pagɛ zunui ma ga é mina anzanu vulu»</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2"/>Kɛlɛ tama, nii a kɛ koloɠologi maala, fizɔgɛ zunui ɠilagilagi ɓɔɠɔ anzai ɠɛ zea, anzanui ɠilagilagi ɓɔɠɔ zinigi ɠɛ zea. <verse eid="1CO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3"/>Zunui zini tosuʋɛ ɠɛ anzanui ʋɛ, anzai anzanu losuʋɛ ɠɛ ɠana nɔ sinigi ʋɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4"/>Mazɔlɔɔ anzai ɓusɛi la nɔ ga tɔ ɓɔɠɔi nɔnɔ, toɠa ga sinigi nɔnɔ. Zenɔ ɠana é la, anzazinigi ɓusɛi la ɓalaa nɔ ga tɔ ɓɔɠɔi nɔnɔ, toɠa ga anzai nɔnɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5"/>À mina yeeɠula wa-lakobai wu, kɛni wa zoloona su yeeɠɛɠala laawu, nii a kɛ wo ɓɔɠɔ ve GALA falii ya. Naa ʋolu wo ɠale ma ɓɔɠɔ ma, naa ɠa a kɛ, Setana mina wo lɛ ga, ga wa ɓɔɠɔzotalai maaʋele. <verse eid="1CO 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6"/>Nà nii wosu, gè wo ɠula ɠeleɠele dɛɛ, kɛlɛ deve laade. <verse eid="1CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7"/>A la nɛɛ bɛ̀ ga ɛsɛ pɛ ge ɠɛ ga nɔ̀un kɛʋele, kɛlɛ ɛsɛ ta ná-vebɛanii ʋe, GALA ge fea zea, ta nɔnɔ ɠa ga nii, zɔi nɔnɔi ɠɛ ga nuu.<verse eid="1CO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8"/>Nà bosu naati ma, niiti ti la ga anzazini, ta niiti ti la zini bɛ, ta poanzaiti, ga pagɛ ti ma, ti yɛ ɠana, eɠɛʋelei gè la. <verse eid="1CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9"/>Kɛlɛ ni wo la zoosu wo ʋa ɓɔɠɔ zo, à vului ɠɛ, mazɔlɔɔ soloogɛ wo vului ɠɛ, wa ʋa ɗa ɠalasu ga ɓɔɠɔyiimai.<verse eid="1CO 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10"/>Zɔiti ti vului ɠɛai, devei gè bosu, nà laade gè ʋa ɠɛ bosu, Maliɠii ɠa é bosu: Anzanui fuluai, é mina ɠula sinigi ya. <verse eid="1CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11"/>Ni a ɠulana zea, é mina mɔ zei zini bɛ ʋolu, ɓaa é ti yɔɠɔzuɓɛtɛ ta sinigi. Zunui mina ɠɛlɛ anzai ʋa.<verse eid="1CO 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12"/>Nà bosu zɔiti ma, Maliɠii woo la ga nii, nà ɓɔɠɔ ʋe ga: Ni kidaaleʋelala anzanui ta ɠa kidaaleʋe zunui ta ya, ni nɛɛʋɛ anzanui ʋɛ ga ti eteai ziɛ ʋɔɔma, zunui mina ɠɛlɛ ba. <verse eid="1CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13"/>Zekana nɔ é la, ni kidaaleʋe anzanui ta ɠa kidaaleʋelala zunui ta ya, ni nɛɛʋɛ zunui ʋɛ ga ti eteai ziɛ ʋɔɔma, maa la nɛɛni, é ʋa ɠɛlɛ sinigi naa ʋa. <verse eid="1CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14"/>Mazɔlɔɔ kidaaleʋelala zinigi ɠa ɲadesu ga anzai maaʋele, kidaaleʋelala anzanui ɠa ɲadesu ga sinigi maaʋele. Ni naa laade, ti-lointi ta ɠɔzɔ, tama gaamazu ti ɲadegɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, zɔi é la ga kidaaleʋe nu, naa a wɔinna ga ti bali ma, à zɛ ná, é naa ɠɛ. Zɔi é ga kidaaleʋe nui, zunui, ɓaa anzanui, naa la ɠilini naazu. GALA ge wo loligɛ ga wo eteai ziɛ ziilɛigi zu. <verse eid="1CO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16"/>Mazɔlɔɔ anzanui, ɗa kwɛɛ ɠale, ni è la ʋaazu è-zinigi ɠizosu? Ɓaa anzazinigi, è kwɛɛ ɠale, ga è la ʋaazu è-anzai ɠizosu?<verse eid="1CO 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">À eteai ziɛ eɠɛʋelei GALA ge wo loliga da ga wo siɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17"/>Ɛsɛ ge ziɛ nɔ naama yai zu nii Maliɠii feai bɛ, siɛgi zu GALA ge tolini da. Zekana gè ma levei veai la Egilisiiti pɛ su. <verse eid="1CO 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18"/>Ni zunui ta latigɛ pɛlɛʋolu pɛ, GALA ge ʋa toli, maa la nɛɛni, é ʋa tatipɛlɛʋolui lɔɔɠu. Ni zunui ta la latini pɛlɛʋolu pɛ GALA ge ʋa toli, maa la nɛɛni, é ʋa ɓɔɠɔ lati pɛlɛʋolu. <verse eid="1CO 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19"/>Tatipɛlɛʋolu vai la ga faa nɔpɛ, tatipɛlɛʋolulala vai ɓalaa la ga faa nɔpɛ. Nii bɔɔlɔai, naa ɠa é ga nu GALA ná-deveiti so. <verse eid="1CO 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20"/>Kɛni ɛsɛ pɛ ge yɛ naama yai zu, nii zɛgai su, eyɛsu GALA ge toli. <verse eid="1CO 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21"/>È ɠɛni ga duɔi, siɛgi zu GALA ge è lolini da? Naa mina è yiizoolɛ, kɛlɛ ni ɗa ɗa-wɔɔlɔyai maazɔlɔɔna, yeezei nɔ naa wu. <verse eid="1CO 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22"/>Mazɔlɔɔ duɔi nii Maliɠii toligai, naa ɠɛa ga Maliɠii ná-wɔɔlɔi. Zenɔ ɠana é la, zɔi é ɠɛni ga wɔɔlɔi toligai ma, naa ɠɛa ga Kilista ná-duɔi. <verse eid="1CO 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23"/>Wo unmɔɔgɛ ga sɔngɔ ɓaa, à mina ɠɛ mɔnɔ ga nuiti ta-luɔ. <verse eid="1CO 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, ɛsɛ pɛ ge yɛ naama yai zu GALA gaazu, nii é yɛni su eyɛsu toligi wo da.<verse eid="1CO 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zɔiti ti la sei pɛlɛla zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25"/>Zɔiti ti la sei pɛlɛla zu, Maliɠii ná-deve la zèa naati ta-vaa zu, kɛlɛ nà kìsu vai wosu, eɠɛʋelei gè maawɔinɠai zɔlɔɔga da Maliɠii ya, ga gè ɠɛ ga lada nu. <verse eid="1CO 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nii gè ɠisiɛzu su pagai, toɠa ga soloogɛ nu ma, é yɛ ɠana, naa lɔɔzei niizu yeeɠɛɠalaiti su vaaɓaagiti ba. <verse eid="1CO 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27"/>Wo ɠiliʋɛ ʋa ɓaa, wa anzanu? Mina pele ɠaiziɛ ga wo ʋa bali ma. È la anzanu vuluni ɓaa? Mina anzanu ɠaiziɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, ni ɗa vului ɠɛɛna, è la koto ɠɛɛni. Ni anzalopo ɓeai a zeina zini bɛ, é la koto ɠɛɛni. Kɛlɛ nuiti ti vuluzu, ta kpɔlɔi zɔlɔɔ eteai zu, tama nà pɔ gè naa ɓudɛ wo maazu.<verse eid="1CO 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29"/>Kɛlɛ nii gè bosu, kɛ̀ɛleaiti, tɔ ɠa é ga nii: Yeeɠɛɠalai zuɓuɠaa, é zo niizu ma niina, kɛni anzazinigiti ti ɠɛ eɠɛ anza la ti ya, <verse eid="1CO 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30"/>zɔiti ti wɔlɔzu, ti ɠɛ eɠɛ ti la wɔlɔzu, zɔiti ti ɠoozunɛai, ti ɠɛ eɠɛ ti ɠoozu la nɛɛni, zɔiti ti ani ɠeyazu, ti ɠɛ eɠɛ ani la ti ya, <verse eid="1CO 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31"/>zɔiti ti ɓɛdɛ ɠulazu ga etea aniiti, é ɠɛ eɠɛ ti la ɓɛdɛ ɠulazu ga ani. Mazɔlɔɔ niima eteai ɠɛʋelei ɠa leʋesu.<verse eid="1CO 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32"/>Nà pɔ ga ziizoolɛ nɔpɛ ge mina ɠɛ wo ma. Zunui anza la bɛ, naa ɠa ɗa yiizoolɛ ga Maliɠii ná-faiti nɔ, toɠa ɗa ɠaaɓa ga é nɛɛ Maliɠii ʋɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33"/>Kɛlɛ zɔi anzai zea, naa ɠa ɗa yiizoolɛ ga etea vaiti, toɠa ɗa ɠaaɓa ga é nɛɛ anzai ʋɛ, <verse eid="1CO 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34"/>gaaɠwɛɛʋɛ su fele. Zenɔ ɠana, anzanui é la zini bɛ, ɓaa anzalopo ɓeai, naa ɠa ɗa yiizoolɛ ga Maliɠii ná-faiti, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa pɔ é ɲade kpusɛi zu ta zɛnvui. Kɛlɛ zɔi ma é zinigi ʋɛ, naa ɠa ɗa yiizoolɛ ga etea vaiti, toɠa ɗa ɠaaɓa ga é nɛɛ sinigi ʋɛ.<verse eid="1CO 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35"/>Nà nii wosu wa-ɠulanuma vai zu, é la ga gè da wo ma ga maaɓaa. Nà pɔ ga wo eteai ziɛ ga pagɔ, nii soloogai, wo ɠiliai yɛ de Maliɠii ʋa, ná-botii zu.<verse eid="1CO 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36"/>Ni ta ɠana, ná-wɛɛin é maazogai, naa wɔin ma niina gola, é ɠigaiziɛ ga é la mɔ maaɓɔun boga, kɛlɛ kɛni faiti ti ɠɛ ga ʋelei maanɛai ti ɠɛ la, é kɛ eɠɛʋelei ná-kisiɛi la. É la koto ɠɛɛni, ti vului ɠɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37"/>Kɛlɛ ni wɛɛn nui, zunu loungoi, a devena yiimaʋɛ, nu la daani ma ga maaɓa, tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ná-devei ʋe, ga é mina anza zei, ni toɠa zoo ɓɔɠɔ zosu, é naa leve ʋelei a ziɛ la, naazu toɠa kɛɛzu ga pagɔ, é mina anzalopoi zei. <verse eid="1CO 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38"/>Naa ɠa é ba, zɔi a ná-anzalopo maazogai zeina, naa ɠa faa ʋagɔ ɠɛɛzu. Zɔi ɓalaa é la ɠɛ seini, nɔnɔi vizɔgɛ.<verse eid="1CO 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Poanzaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39"/>Anzanui fuluai, naa ɠiliʋɛ sinigi ʋa, siɛgi pɛ su naa vulua la. Kɛlɛ ni sinigi a zaana, fiegɛ ga é zei naama nui ʋɛ, nii é pɔ, kɛlɛ kɛni é ɠɛ ga kidaaleʋe nui ta. <verse eid="1CO 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40"/>Kɛlɛ nɔ̀un, nà kìsu vai wosu, undaa ɠa nɛ gola, ni a yɛna ɠana. Nɔ̀un dàaʋɛ da ɓalaa ga GALA Zɛnvui ɠa bà.<verse eid="1CO 7:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8"/>
  <para style="s">Kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti kɔɔ zuaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1"/>Ade ɠida zalaɠa zua vaiti bu, ti ɠulazu kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti bɛ: Ade kwɛni ga «faaɠwɛ ka de pɛ de ya». «Faaɠwɛgi» ɠa ɗa nu waso, kɛlɛ nɛɛbɛi ɠa ɗa nu zapelɔ kidaaleʋei zu. <verse eid="1CO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2"/>Zɔi é ɠisiɛzu ga é faa ɠwɛɛ, naa la dɛ faa ɠwɛɛ, ʋelei maanɛai é kwɛɛ da. <verse eid="1CO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3"/>Kɛlɛ ni nu a GALA nɛɛna ʋɛ, GALA ge naama nui ɠwɛɛ.<verse eid="1CO 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nii é ga zalaɠa zuaiti mii vai, ti ɠulazu kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti bɛ: Ade kwɛɛ ga kɔɔɠɔ gani la ga ani nɔpɛ eteai zu, GALA gila kpegi nɔ ɠa é ná. <verse eid="1CO 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ anɛɛ ni ta ɠɛɛzu tanigaa ma galagiti, geeɠɔlɔgi zu ɓaa zooi ma, galagiti gola mɔinʋɛ, maliɠiiti ti mɔin gola, <verse eid="1CO 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6"/>anɛɛ naa ʋe, adɔnɔi, GALA gila kpe nɔ ɠa, é ade ʋɛ, Ɠɛɛɠɛi, nii é aniiti pɛ kpɛtɛa, nii de zɛnvui wosu zeema, ta Maliɠi ɠila kpe, é ga Yesu Kilista, nii aniiti pɛ ti saɓui zu, da ɓalaa de zɛnvui wosu saɓui zu.<verse eid="1CO 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7"/>Kɛlɛ nui pɛ ge la gaamai naa ɠwɛɛ. Tanigaani ti ɓega ga ɠata kɔɔɠɔ gani fai ʋa mɛtu, niizu ti ɗa naama zuaiti mi, niiti ti ɠulaai ga zalaɠai kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti bɛ, zɛbɛ la ta-ɠisiɛiti ba, ti ɗa ɠisiɛ ga daamianigi naati ti ti ɠɔzɔa. <verse eid="1CO 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8"/>Tama daamianigi laade, é ʋa ɠɛ de maaɓuɠazu GALA ba. Ni de la daami woni, naa la ta ɠulazu de la, ni da ta miina, naa la ta laazu de ma.<verse eid="1CO 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9"/>À dama ga wa-wɔɔlɔyai nii wo sɔlɔɔgai, naa mina ɠɛ ga kɔɠɔziɠa zaɓu zɛbɛsulala nuiti bɛ kidaaleʋei zu, ti ʋa loo kotoi zu. <verse eid="1CO 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ni zɛbɛsulala nui ta ɠa è ɠaana zeini sale ɠɔɔ ʋɛlɛi wu, ɗɛi faaɠwɛgi è ya, è ɗa daami wo, ná-kisiɛi la iɲɔdɔa ɓaa, é ʋa ɗa suaiti mi, ti ɠulaai ga zalaɠai kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti bɛ? <verse eid="1CO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11"/>Naa maaʋele ma, zɛbɛsulala nui naa undaa ɠa ʋilisu, ɗa-vaaɠwɛgi maaʋele ma, ɠɛɛɠɛloin naa, nii Kilista zaai bɛ. <verse eid="1CO 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12"/>Siɛgi zu wo kotoi ɠɛɛzu la ga naa ma zii ɠɛɛɠɛleaiti daalɔɠɔma, wo ta-ɠisiɛi maawana, nii zɛbɛ la ba, Kilista ɓɔɠɔi ɠana wo kotoi ɠɛɛzu daalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="1CO 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13"/>Naa ɠa é ba, ni daamianigi ɠa a kɛ̀ɛloin loo kotoi zu, eyɛsu pɛ, gè la mɔ sua mia, naa ɠa a kɛ gè mina kɛ̀ɛloin loo.<verse eid="1CO 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9"/>
  <para style="s">Keela vai ma zobogi ta ma ɠulanumai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1"/>Gè la ga wɔɔlɔ ɓaa? Gè la ga keela ɓaa? Gè la ɠɛni Yesu ɠaani ɓaa, de-Maliɠii? Wo la ga nà-botii zulɔnɔgi ɓaa, Maliɠii ná-botii zu? <verse eid="1CO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2"/>Ni gè la ga keela nui tanigaani gaazu, nà ga keelai wɔun wo ʋɛ. Mazɔlɔɔ wa ga nà-keela wotii ma ʋoogi Maliɠii ná-botii zu.<verse eid="1CO 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3"/>Naa ɠa nà ɗa ɓɔɠɔ maavaawo da naati daalɔɠɔma, niiti ti màalɔɔzu. <verse eid="1CO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4"/>Naama zobo ge la gi ʋɛ ɓaa, gi ʋa daamianigi ta kpɔɔle anii zɔlɔɔ gá-wotii maaʋele ma? <verse eid="1CO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5"/>Naama zobo ge la ɓena ɠɛ gi ya ɓaa, gi ʋa kidaaleʋe anzanui ta ʋilɛ ʋolu, é ɠɛ ga gi-anza, eɠɛʋelei keelai zɔiti ti kɛɛzu la, ta Maliɠii deɠeiti, ta Piyɛlɛni? <verse eid="1CO 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6"/>Ɓaa mu, nà-o, Ɓalanaɓase-o, gá nɔ ɠa gá ɗa botii ɠɛ pɛ, gi ʋa ɠɔnɔgi zɔlɔɔ? <verse eid="1CO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7"/>Ɓɛ ɠa a ɗa salaʋusu vai ɠɛ ga tɔ ɓɔɠɔi yeaɠɔligi? Ɓɛ ɠa a ɗa leezɛn ɓelei leʋe, é la ma waai ta mia? Ɓɛ ɠa a ɗa togani ɓulugi makɛ, é la togani ɓulugi ma ɲiimiɗɛi ta ɓɔlea?<verse eid="1CO 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8"/>Niima vaiti gè ti wosu, ti la ga nuɓusɛiti ta-leveiti nɔ, mazɔlɔɔ GALA ná-tɔgi ɓalaa ka ti wosu. <verse eid="1CO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9"/>Mazɔlɔɔ sɛʋɛʋɛ Moize ná-tɔgi zu ga: «Mina nikɛi laaʋɛ ɠili, a ɠɛna moloi ɠaalia ga.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">TSV 25:4</ref></char>.</char></note> GALA ka yiizoolɛzu ga nikɛiti nɔ ɓaa? <verse eid="1CO 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10"/>Ɓaa, gi maaʋele laade, é ʋa ɠɛ nii wosu da? Ungo, giya ɠa naa zɛʋɛai gá-vaa zu. Kɛni zɔi é wozai wolizu, ta zɔi é moloi loɠazu, ti losuʋɛ ɠɛ kitogi zu, ga ta tɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ su. <verse eid="1CO 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11"/>Ni gi zɛnvu zu vaiti fazaga wo zaama, faa ɲɔu ɠana ɓaa, ni gá gɔnɔ zɔlɔɔna wo-yeaɠɔligiti su? <verse eid="1CO 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12"/>Ni naama zobogi ɠa zɔiti zea wo unda, naama zobogi la gi ya wo unda, é ʋa leʋe naati ba ɓaa?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Kɛlɛ anɛɛ naa ʋe, gi la naama zobogi zeɠeni, tɔun kɛni gi yeezeiɗa fai pɛ bu, naa ɠa a kɛ, gi mina pele leʋe Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi luɠɔ, é ʋilɛ Kilista ʋa. <verse eid="1CO 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13"/>Tama wo kwɛɛ ga niiti ti boti ɲadegai ɠɛɛzu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, naati ta ɗa ti-ɠɔnɔgi zɔlɔɔ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu. Ta zɔiti ti zalaɠai ɠulazu zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, naati ta ɗa tɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ zalaɠaiti su, ti ɠulazu zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. <verse eid="1CO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14"/>Zekana é la ɓalaa, Maliɠii deveʋɛ ga niiti ti Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeelizu, naati ti ɠɔnɔgi zɔlɔɔ Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli vai zu.<verse eid="1CO 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15"/>Nɔ̀un, gè la niima zobogi tanɔpɛ seɠeni, gè la sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛzu ɓalaa ga gè ʋa ɠɛ niima vaiti maalolisu ga gè ti zɔlɔɔ ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ. Tɔun nɛɛʋɛ bɛ̀ vɔlɔ ga gè za, kɛlɛ nu nɔpɛ ge mina lɛbiyai ma ungi ɠulaa zèa! <verse eid="1CO 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16"/>Nà ɠɛna Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeelia, naa la bɛ̀ ga ɓɔɠɔ wɔɔlɔ vaa, mazɔlɔɔ ma ɠeleɠele ge la ná, kɛni gè kɛ. Maanɔɠɔ ɠa tùɠɔ, ni gè la Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeelini! <verse eid="1CO 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17"/>Ni nà ɓɔɠɔi zìimai ɠa gè kɛɛzu la, kulanuma ɠa bɛ̀ naazu, kɛlɛ ni nà kɛɛzu nɔ ga kɛɛɠeleɠele ge la ná vaa, toɠa ùnma ga kasɔ nii kalivaai mà. <verse eid="1CO 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18"/>Nà-kulanumai ɠa ga leeni naazu? Tɔ ɠa é ga, gè Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli, nii geya la ba, gè mina naama losuʋɛ zeɠe ʋɛ, nii é ga nɔ̀nɔi, nɛ̀i gè ga Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli nui.<verse eid="1CO 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19"/>Nà ga wɔɔlɔ, gè la ga nu nɔpɛ ná-duɔ. Anɛɛ naa ʋe, gè ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛa ga ɛsɛ pɛ ná-duɔi, naa ɠa a kɛ, ni toɠa zoo ɠɛɛzu, gè ma mɔinmɔin gola zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="1CO 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20"/>Nà ɠɛna botii ɠɛa Zuifuiti saama, nà ɠɛɛzu eɠɛ Zuifui ta, nii a kɛ gè Zuifuiti maazɔlɔɔ. Nà ɠɛna zɔiti ba, ti Moize ná-tɔgi wu, nà botii ɠɛɛzu ti zaama, eɠɛ nà ɠɛ tɔgi wu, nii a kɛ gè ti maazɔlɔɔ, anɛɛ ni nà ɓɔɠɔi gè la tɔgi naa wu. <verse eid="1CO 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21"/>Zenɔ ɠana é la, siɛgi zu gè naati saama la, niiti ti la Moize ná-tɔgi ɠwɛɛ, ná ɗa ziɛ ga ti ɠɛʋele, eɠɛ gè la tɔ bu, nii a kɛ gè ti maazɔlɔɔ. Naa la bosu ga gè la ɠolozu GALA ná-tɔgi ʋɛ, mazɔlɔɔ nà ɠolozu Kilista ná-tɔgi ʋɛ. <verse eid="1CO 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22"/>Zɔiti zɛbɛ la ti ʋa kidaaleʋei zu, gè ɠɛa ga zɛbɛsulala nu ga naati kɛʋele, nii a kɛ gè ti maazɔlɔɔ. Nà ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛɛzu ga ti pɛ kɛʋelei, nii a kɛ, ʋele-o-ʋele gè tanigaani kizo. <verse eid="1CO 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23"/>Tama nà naa pɛ kɛɛzu Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi vaa ma, nii a kɛ gè nɔ̀nɔ zɔlɔɔ su.<verse eid="1CO 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24"/>Wo la kwɛɛ ɓaa, ga zɔiti ti ɓizɛzu ɓɔɠɔ yɛ kpizɛi zu, ti pɛ ta ɗa ɓizɛ, kɛlɛ ti zaama, nu ɠila nɔ ɠa a ɗa zalai zɔlɔɔ? À ɓizɛ ɠana ga wo ʋa zalai zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="1CO 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25"/>Kpizɛ wo nuiti ta ɗa ɓɔɠɔ zo, ti yeeɠula faa mɔinmɔin su, nii a kɛ ti lɛbiya wɔɔlɔgi zɔlɔɔ, é la lɛbisu, é ɠoloɠolo. Kɛlɛ adɔnɔi, da kɛɛzu, nii a kɛ de lɛbiya wɔɔlɔgi zɔlɔɔ, nii é la ɠoloɠologa eyɛsu ɠɔ. <verse eid="1CO 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nà ɓizɛzu, kɛlɛ ani ɠa gàazu logai ba. Ɲɛpii gè kɔɔzu, fiilɛi laade gè ʋa ɠɛ doɠazu. <verse eid="1CO 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27"/>Nà ɓakpasu kpùsɛi ma, é ɠolo bɛ̀, naa ɠa a kɛ nà GALA daawooi laazeelina nuiti ma, nà ɓɔɠɔi gè mina loo bu.<verse eid="1CO 9:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10"/>
  <para style="s">Kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti kɔɔ vai <optbreak/> maaɲɛɛ vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, nà pɔ ga wo ɠitoo su ga ade-mɛmɛwolani pɛ ti ɠɛni tonaɓiingi wu, ti pɛ ti ɓudɛni kpoloɗɛi maazu. <verse eid="1CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2"/>Ti pɛ ti ɓatizeni tonaɓiingi wu ta kpoloɗɛi wu, ta-ɠilibalai zu ta Moize. <verse eid="1CO 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3"/>Ti pɛ ti zɛnvu zu laamiani sii ɠilagi miini. <verse eid="1CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4"/>Ti pɛ ti ɓɔɔleni ga zɛnvu zu ɓɔɔle ɗɛ zii ɠilagi, mazɔlɔɔ ti ɓɔɔleni zɛnvu zu vasai ʋa, nii é ɠɛni ti ʋolu. Kilista ɠa é ɠɛni ga naama vasai. <verse eid="1CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5"/>Kɛlɛ ti-ma mɔinmɔin ti la ɠɛni GALA ziimani, naa ɠa é ba, ti zaani teʋebai zu.<verse eid="1CO 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6"/>Tama niima vaiti ti ɠɛa de ʋɛ ga poogi, nii a kɛ de mina mɔ kisiɛ ɲɔu wo, eɠɛʋelei ti kɛɛni la. <verse eid="1CO 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7"/>À mina ɠɛ ga kɔɔɠɔ gani kɔɔ nua, eɠɛʋelei ti tanigaani ti kɛɛni la. Sɛʋɛʋɛ ɠani GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga: «Nuɓusɛiti ti zeini, ti daamii ta kpɔɔlei wo. Naa ʋolu, ti wuzeɠeni, ti ɗa ɠaɠo.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 32:6">Ɛgz 32:6</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8"/>Ade mina ɓɔɠɔ ve koloɠologi ya, eɠɛʋelei ti tanigaani ti kɛɛni la. Naa maaʋele ma, nu waaʋuufelegɔ maazu saʋagɔ (23.000) zaani folo ɠilagi nɔ. <verse eid="1CO 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9"/>Ade mina Kilista zuɠɔɠɔ, eɠɛʋelei ti tanigaani ti kɛɛni la, kaaliiti ti ti ɲiini, ti za. <verse eid="1CO 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10"/>À mina ɓɔɛ unsu, eɠɛʋelei ti tanigaani ti ɓɔɛni la unsu, geezuɠeelai ti ʋaa, é ti zuwuɠaaleʋe. <verse eid="1CO 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11"/>Niima vaiti ti zeini ti ma, ti ɠɛ ade ʋɛ ga poogi, ti zɛʋɛ ade lɛnɛ faa ma, adɛiti yeeɠɛɠala ɠaaɓelagi zeeliai ade ma.<verse eid="1CO 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12"/>Naa ɠa é ba, zɔi é ɠisiɛzu ga toɠa loni, é dama, a ʋa loo. <verse eid="1CO 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13"/>Tɛga nɔpɛ ge la dɛ zeelini wo ma, nii ma zii la dɛ zeelini nu ɠili ma. GALA é ga wooɠɛɠila GALAGI, é la vaa bu pɛ, ga tɛga zeeli wo ma, é ɓudɛ wo-zɛbɛi maazu. Kɛlɛ yeei tɛgai ʋaazu la, toɠa zɛbɛi ve wo ʋɛ, wo ɠula ɠeleɠele sɔlɔɔ su, nii a kɛ wo ziɛ bu.<verse eid="1CO 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nɛ̀ɛɲɔɠɔiti, à maaɠooza kɔɔɠɔ gani kɔɔ vai ʋa. <verse eid="1CO 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15"/>Nà ɓɔɛzu wo ʋɔ, eɠɛ ɠima nuiti, wa ɓɔɠɔi à ɠida naa wu, nii gè bosu. <verse eid="1CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16"/>Tuya ɗaawɔi de GALA mamasu ma vaa zu, da ɠɛna ɓɔɔlea la, naa laade é ʋa ɠɛ ga da-ɠilibalai Kilista ɲamai vaa zu ɓaa? Ɓului de galeɠalezu, da ɠɛna mia, naa laade é ʋa ɠɛ ga da-ɠilibalai Kilista ɓusɛi vaa zu ɓaa? <verse eid="1CO 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17"/>Ɓului ɠa ɠila nɔ. Anɛɛ ni ade mɔinʋɛ, da ga kpusɛ ɠila kpegi, mazɔlɔɔ da dɔnɔ zɔlɔɔsu ɓului naa zu.<verse eid="1CO 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18"/>Izilayɛle nuiti pɛtɛ: Niiti ti zalaɠa zuai ta miizu, naati ti la kpɔfaamai zu nɛi ɓaa, ta zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ? <verse eid="1CO 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19"/>Leeni ɠa gè bosu naazu? Kɔɔɠɔ ganigi, ɓaa suai é ɠulazu bɛ ga zalaɠai, naati ka tosu ti ʋa ɓaa? Naa laade! <verse eid="1CO 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20"/>Kɛlɛ nii ti kulazu ga zalaɠai, ta naa ɠulazu ga zalaɠai inɛgiti bɛ, GALA taade. Tama gè la pɔ ga kpɔfaama ʋa ɠɛ wo yɔɠɔzu wa inɛgiti. <verse eid="1CO 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21"/>Wo la zooga wo ʋa ɓɔɔle ga Maliɠii ná-ziawɔi, wo ɗa ɓɔɔle mɔnɔ ga inɛgiti ta-ɗaawɔi. Wo la zooga wo ʋa Maliɠii ná-daamianigi mi, wo ɗa inɛgiti ta-laamianigi mi mɔnɔ. <verse eid="1CO 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22"/>Ada pɔ de Maliɠii ná-toloi wuzeɠe ɓaa? Wa kaazu ga de zuɓaaʋɛ tɔun ba ɓaa?<verse eid="1CO 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fai pɛ ge ɠɛ é GALA dɛbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23"/>Tanigaa ti ɠɛ ma: «Zobo feeʋɛ nu ʋɛ ga è fai ma zii pɛ kɛ,» kɛlɛ kulanuma la fai pɛ ba. «Zobo feeʋɛ nu ʋɛ ga è fai ma zii pɛ kɛ,» tama fai pɛ ge la vizɔni kidaaleʋe nuiti ma. <verse eid="1CO 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24"/>Nu nɔpɛ ge mina ɠisiɛ tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ná-faa nɔ zu, kɛlɛ kɛni é ɠisiɛ ɓalaa zɔiti ta-vaa zu.<verse eid="1CO 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25"/>À naa pɛ mi, nii é ʋɔdizu dɔɔɠɔi zu, à mina gaazaɠa bo wa-ɠisiɛi zu ga mini ɠa seɠeai ná. <verse eid="1CO 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26"/>Mazɔlɔɔ «zooi ta gaa ɠaniiti ta ga Maliɠii nɔnɔ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 24:1">Guy 24:1</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="1CO 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27"/>Ni kidaaleʋelala nui ta a wo lolina daami wo faa ma, wa vaana bu ga wo li, à li. Nii kpein a fe wo ya, à ti pɛ ta mi, wo mina gaazaɠa bo wa-ɠisiɛi zu. <verse eid="1CO 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28"/>Kɛlɛ ni nui ta a ɠɛna wo ma: «Nii ɠulaʋɛ ga zalaɠai kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti bɛ,» à mina naa ta mi, naama nui maaʋele ma, ta ná-kisiɛi maaʋele ma. <verse eid="1CO 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29"/>Nà nii wosu ʋɛ, wɔun wa-ɠisiɛi ma vaa laade, kɛlɛ zɔi ná-kisiɛi ma vaa ʋe. Leeni vaa zu taɠili ná-kisiɛi ʋaazu nà-wɔɔlɔyai lukpɔɠaaleʋezu? <verse eid="1CO 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30"/>Ni nà GALA mamana daamii vaa zu, leeni vaa zu zeli a lo mà naama vaa zu, nii gè mamagi wogai ma vaa zu?<verse eid="1CO 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31"/>Naa ɠa é ba, wo ɠɛni daami wosu, wo ɠɛni kpɔɔle wosu, wo ɠɛni faa nɔpɛ kɛɛzu, à ti pɛ kɛ, é ɠɛ ga lɛbiyai GALA bɛ. <verse eid="1CO 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32"/>Naa ma, wo-ziɛ ʋelei pɛ su, à mina ɠɛ ga kaka saɓu Zuifuiti bɛ, ɓaa zii ɠiligiti, ɓaa GALA ná-Egilisii zu nuiti. <verse eid="1CO 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33"/>À ziɛ ga kɛ̀ʋele, nà ɠaaɓaazu, gè nuiti ziima fai pɛ su, gè la nà-kulanuma ɠaiziɛzu, kɛlɛ kɛni nui ma mɔinmɔin nɔnɔi, naa ɠa a kɛ, ti ɠizo.<verse eid="1CO 10:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1"/>À ʋokɔɠɔ mà, eɠɛʋelei gè ʋokɔɠɔsu da Kilista ma.<verse eid="1CO 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Anzanui nɔungi maalɔɔɠu vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2"/>Nà wo maamusɛzu, tɔɔzei wa ɠizɛsu sù, fai pɛ su, ta wa ziɛzu ga tɛnɛ gooiti kpein, gè ti woni wo ma.<verse eid="1CO 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, nà pɔ ga wo nii ɠaaɠa: Kilista ɠa é ga zunuiti pɛ ma ungi, zunui ɠa é ga anzanui ma ungi, GALA ka é ga Kilista ma ungi. <verse eid="1CO 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4"/>Zunu nɔpɛ a ɠɛna GALA falia, ɓaa é ɗa GALA gooi wo, é ani ʋɛɛ nɔungi ma, naa ɠa ɓaaɠulazu ma ungi ma. <verse eid="1CO 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5"/>Kɛlɛ anzanu nɔpɛ a ɠɛna GALA falia, ɓaa é ɗa GALA gooi wo, é la ani ʋɛɛni unma, naa ɠa ɓaaɠulazu ma ungi ma, kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ nɔungi a ɓuye. <verse eid="1CO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ni anzanui la ani ʋɛɛni unma, kɛni é nɔundeɠai ɓalaa leʋe ma. Tama ni toɠa ga unfe faa anzanui ʋɛ, ga é ta leʋe nɔundeɠai ʋa, ɓaa é nɔungi ɓuye, kɛni é ani ʋɛɛ unma. <verse eid="1CO 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7"/>Maa la nɛɛni ga zunui nɔungi maalɔɔɠu, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa ga GALA maaniinigi ta ná-lɛbiyai. Kɛlɛ anzanui ɠa ga zunui ná-lɛbiyai. <verse eid="1CO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8"/>Mazɔlɔɔ zunui la ɓɛtɛni, é ʋa ɠula anzanui zu, kɛlɛ anzanui ɠa kulaai zunui zu. <verse eid="1CO 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9"/>Zunui la ɠɛni ɓɛtɛni anzanui ʋɛ, kɛlɛ anzanui ɠa kpɛtɛai zunui ʋɛ. <verse eid="1CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10"/>Naa ɠa é ba, geezuɠeelaiti ta-vaa ma, anzanui maanɛɛʋɛ é zobogi ma ʋoogi zɔlɔɔ nɔungi ma. <verse eid="1CO 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11"/>Naati pɛ ta nɔnɔ, Maliɠii ná-pelei ma, anzanui la ɓɔɠɔyeema yɛ, ni zunui laade, zunui la ɓɔɠɔyeema yɛ, ni anzanui laade. <verse eid="1CO 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12"/>Mazɔlɔɔ, eɠɛʋelei anzanui ɓɛtɛni la, é ɠula zunui zu, zekana é la, zunui ɓalaa ɠa ná anzanui zaɓui zu, ti pɛ ti zeɠeʋɛ GALA pɔ.<verse eid="1CO 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13"/>À ɠida lɛɛ bu wa ɓɔɠɔgoi: Fizɔgɛ nɛi anzanui ma ga é GALA fali, unba ɲakai? <verse eid="1CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14"/>Etea vaiti ti la wo ɠalasu ɓaa, ga toɠa ga unfe faa zunui ʋɛ, nɔundeɠai wola a ɠoozana? <verse eid="1CO 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15"/>Kɛlɛ toɠa ga lɛbiya vaa anzanui ʋɛ, nɔundeɠai ɠooza. Tɔɔzei undeɠai veeʋɛ anzanui ʋɛ, ga é ɗa maalɔɔɠu. <verse eid="1CO 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16"/>Ni nui ta wɔinni é niima vaiti sakpe, gá bosu ma ga gi ziɛ ʋele la ga naa pɔlɔma, anɛɛ ɓalaa GALA ná-Egilisiiti bɛ.<verse eid="1CO 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maliɠii ná-daamii wo fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Matiyo 26:26-29</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Maleke 14:22-25</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luke 22:14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17"/>Niima vai gè ʋaazu bosu wo ma, gè la zooga gè ʋa wo maamusɛ, mazɔlɔɔ wa-ɠaalɛbaiti ti la wo ɓɛtɛzu, kɛni ti ɗa wo ɠoloɠolo. <verse eid="1CO 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18"/>Mɔunpa, bogɛ mà ga siɛgi zu wo Egilisi ɠaalɛbai wosu da, zeeɠaaɠwɛɛ vaiti ta wo zaama, gè lago laa da. <verse eid="1CO 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19"/>Mazɔlɔɔ kɛni zeeɠaaɠwɛɛ vaiti ti ɠɛ wo zaama, naa ɠa a kɛ, zɔiti ti zɔlegai wo zaama, naati ti ɠa. <verse eid="1CO 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20"/>Siɛgi zu wo ɠaalɛɛzu ba la, Maliɠii ná-daamii laade wo ʋa ɠɛ bosu. <verse eid="1CO 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21"/>Mazɔlɔɔ siɛgi zu wo daami wosu da, ɛsɛ ka tɔ ɓɔɠɔ nɔ ná-daamiani kpɛtɛai nɔ miizu, tama pului tanigaani ma, dɔɔi tanigaani sogai niina. <verse eid="1CO 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22"/>Pɛlɛa ti la wo ʋɛ ɓaa, ʋɛti wa daamii ta kpɔɔleiti bo ná? Ɓaa mu GALA ná-Egilisii ɠa wo ɓaazeɠezu ma, wo ɗa zɔiti unfe, niiti ani la ti ya? Kɛni gè wo maamusɛ naazu ɓaa? Gè la wo maamusɛzu naazu ɲɛgɛlɛin!<verse eid="1CO 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23"/>Mazɔlɔɔ, kalagi gè sɔlɔɔni Maliɠii ya, naa ɠa gè feeni wo ya: Kpidii nii ti Maliɠii Yesu lɔɔni la sili nuiti zeezu, ti ʋa paa, é ɓului zeɠeni. <verse eid="1CO 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24"/>Kpegai ma ga mamagi ve GALA bɛ, é galeɠaleni, é ɠɛ ma: «Nii ɠa é ga kpùsɛi, nii é wo vaa ma. À nii ɠɛ, wo ɠizɛ sù.» <verse eid="1CO 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25"/>Zenɔ ɠana, daamii wogai ma, é ziawɔi zeɠeni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ziawɔi nii ɠa é ga minazeɠe niinɛi, daazeeliai ga mà ɲamai maaʋele. Siɛnɔpɛ su wa ɠɛna ɓɔɔlea la ga nii, à nii ɠɛ, wo ɠizɛ sù.» <verse eid="1CO 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26"/>Mazɔlɔɔ, siɛnɔpɛ su wo niima ɓului miizu la, wo ɓɔɔle ga niima ɗaawɔi, wa Maliɠii ná-saa vai lɛɛzu, eyɛsu é ʋa.<verse eid="1CO 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27"/>Naa ɠa é ba, zɔi nɔpɛ é la Maliɠii ná-ɓului miini ga mi ʋele, é ʋa ɓɔɔle ga Maliɠii ná-ziawɔi ga ɓɔɔle ʋele, toɠa ɠɛ ga sɔba nu Maliɠii ɓusɛi ta ma ɲamaiti faa zu. <verse eid="1CO 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28"/>Naa ɠa é ba, ɛsɛ pɛ ge ɓɔɠɔ vɛɠɛlɛfɛɠɛlɛ, aisa é ʋa niima ɓului ta mi, ta aisa é ʋa ɓɔɔle ga niima ɗaawɔi, <verse eid="1CO 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29"/>mazɔlɔɔ zɔi é daamii ta kpɔɔlei wosu, é la ɠidaani naama aniiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ wu ta Maliɠii ɓusɛi, naa ɠa daamii ta kpɔɔlei wosu, é ɓɔɠɔ ʋeelala. <verse eid="1CO 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30"/>Niima vaa ma, seeɓɛ nu mɔinmɔin ka wo zaama, ta zɛbɛsulala nuiti, ta ma mɔinmɔin ge zaa. <verse eid="1CO 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31"/>Ni da ɓɔɠɔ vɛɠɛlɛfɛɠɛlɛna da ɓɔɠɔ, de la ʋeelalaa. <verse eid="1CO 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32"/>Siɛgi zu Maliɠii de lukpɔɠaaleʋezu la, é de ɠolo. Toɠa naa ɠɛɛzu, nii a kɛ de mina lɔ peelalai zu ʋɔɔma da eteai.<verse eid="1CO 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33"/>Naa ɠa é ba, kɛ̀ɛleaiti, siɛgi zu wo ɠaalɛɛzu ba la, daami wo fai ma, à ɓɔɠɔ maaɓɔun, wo ɠilagilagi pɛ. <verse eid="1CO 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34"/>Ni pului ɠa nui ta ma, é daami wo ná-pɛlɛi wu, naa ɠa a kɛ, wo mina ɠaalɛ ba, wo ʋa ɓɔɠɔ ʋeelala. Siɛgi zu nà ʋaana la, nà fai mɔtaiti gaaɠula ba.<verse eid="1CO 11:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12"/>
  <para style="s">Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ná-vebɛaniiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, nii é ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ná-vebɛaniiti ma vai, wɔin ɠa mà, ga wo gaamai ɠwɛɛ, é lo vebɛanii naati ba. <verse eid="1CO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2"/>Wo kwɛɛ, siɛgi zu wo ɠɛni la dɛ ga GALA kwɛɛtala nuiti, ti wo zoni, ti wo lɔ kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti kɔɔ vai zu, niiti daa la ti ʋa. <verse eid="1CO 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nà bosu wo ma ga: Nu nɔpɛ é ɓɔɛzu GALA Zɛnvui zɛbɛi zu, é la zooga é ʋa ɠɛ ma: «Yesu ɠoto faan!» Ta nu nɔpɛ ge la zooga é ʋa ɠɛ ma: «Yesu ɠa ga Maliɠii,» kɛni Zɛnvu Ɲadegai lo tuɠɔ.<verse eid="1CO 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4"/>Vebɛanii ma zii mɔinʋɛ, kɛlɛ Zɛnvu Ɲadega ɠilagi nɔ ɠa, é ti veezu. <verse eid="1CO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5"/>Botii ɠɛʋelei mɔinʋɛ, kɛlɛ Maliɠi ɠilagi nɔ ɠa, ti ɠɛɛzu bɛ. <verse eid="1CO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6"/>Faa ɠɛɛ ʋelei ma zii mɔinʋɛ, kɛlɛ GALA gilagi nɔ ɠa, é naati pɛ kɛɛzu ɛsɛ pɛ tetemazu.<verse eid="1CO 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7"/>Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ɠa ɠulazu kɛlɛma ɛsɛ gilagilagi ʋɛ ga vebɛanii maaʋele, ɛsɛ pɛ ná-kulanumai ma vaa ma. <verse eid="1CO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8"/>Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ɠima ɓɔɛi wo fai veeʋɛ ta ya, Zɛnvu Ɲadega ɠila kpegi nɔ faaɠwɛ kpɔɛi ve taɠili zea. <verse eid="1CO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9"/>Zɛnvu Ɲadega ɠilagi naa nɔ ɠa, é kidaaleʋei veai taɠili zea, Zɛnvu Ɲadega ɠilagi naa nɔ nu ɠɛdɛ vebɛanii ve taɠili zea. <verse eid="1CO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10"/>Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ma zobogi veeʋɛ taɠili zea, é ɗa laavɔɔ vaiti kɛ, é vebɛanii ve taɠili zea, naa ɗa GALA gooi wo. É zɛnvuiti ta-vaiti zeeɠaaɠwɛ zobogi veeʋɛ taɠili zea. É ma zobogi veeʋɛ taɠili zea, é ɗa ɓɔɛ zii woo ɠiligiti su, é ma zobogi ve taɠili zea, é ɗa daawooleʋegi wo. <verse eid="1CO 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11"/>Zɛnvu Ɲadega ɠila kpegi ɓɔɠɔi nɔ ɠa, é niima vaiti kɛɛzu, é ɗa ti pɛ gaaɠwɛ nu ɠilagilagi ʋa, eɠɛʋelei é pɔ la.<verse eid="1CO 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kpusɛ ɠilagi baalobazuʋɛ mɔinɗai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12"/>Mazɔlɔɔ eɠɛʋelei kpusɛi la ɠila kpe nɔ, kɛlɛ baalobazuʋɛ mɔinɗai, tama kpusɛi ʋaalobazuʋɛ kpein, anɛɛ ni ti mɔinʋɛ, ta nɔ ga kpusɛ ɠilagi, zekana Kilista la. <verse eid="1CO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ade pɛ de ɓatizegɛ Zɛnvu Ɲadega ɠilagi zaalai zu, ga de ɠɛ ga kpusɛ ɠila, é ɠɛni ga Zuifuiti, é ɠɛni ga niiti ti la ga Zuifua, é ɠɛni ga duɔiti, é ɠɛni ga wɔɔlɔiti, de pɛ de ɓɔɔlea Zɛnvu Ɲadega ɠilagi naa ná-ziɛungi zu.<verse eid="1CO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14"/>Zekana é la, kpusɛi ʋaalobazuʋɛ la ɠila nɔ, kɛlɛ mɔinʋɛ. <verse eid="1CO 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15"/>Ni nu ɠɔɠɔi a ɠɛna ma: «Gè la ga nu yeei, naa ma, gè la kpusɛi ʋa,» naa la ʋaazu kpeteʋezu kpusɛi ʋa. <verse eid="1CO 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16"/>Ni nu woii a ɠɛna ma: «Gè la ga nu ɠaazuɠɛzɛi, naa ma, gè la kpusɛi ʋa,» naa la ʋaazu kpeteʋezu kpusɛi ʋa. <verse eid="1CO 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17"/>Ni kpusɛi pɛ ge ɠɛni ga nu ɠaazuɠɛzɛi nɔ, nu a la ɗa faa mɛni ɠale? Ti pɛ ma ta la ɠɛna ga nu woii nɔ, nu a la ɗa aniiti makugi mɛni ɠale? <verse eid="1CO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18"/>Gaamazu, GALA ge kpusɛi ʋaalobazuʋɛ ɠilagilagi pɛ togɛ ba, eɠɛʋelei é ɠɛni pɔ la. <verse eid="1CO 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19"/>Ni ti pɛ ti ɠɛni ga baalobazu ɠila kpe nɔ, mini ɠa kpusɛi a la ɠɛ ná? <verse eid="1CO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20"/>Naa ɠa é ba, baalobazuʋɛ mɔinʋɛ, kɛlɛ kpusɛ ɠila kpe nɔ ʋe.<verse eid="1CO 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21"/>Nu ɠaazuɠɛzɛi la zooga é ʋa ɠɛ nu yeei ma: «Màavaa la è ʋa!» Nu ungi ɓalaa la zooga é ʋa ɠɛ nu ɠɔɠɔiti ma: «Màavaa la wo ʋa!» <verse eid="1CO 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22"/>Kɛlɛ tɔun, kpusɛi ʋaalobazuʋɛti zɛbɛ la ti zu, naati ka nu ɓɛdɛi ti ʋa. <verse eid="1CO 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23"/>Zɔiti de ti ʋɛtɛsu ga unfema wola la ti ʋɛ, naati ka da ɗa unfemai ve ti ʋɛ, é leʋe zɔiti ba. Zɔiti é la zolooni ga nu ti laaseigi wo, da ɗa naati so ga pagɔ, <verse eid="1CO 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24"/>kɛlɛ tɔun zɔiti maavaa la naa ʋa. GALA ge kpusɛi ɓɛtɛʋɛ ga kɛʋelei ta, nii a kɛ lɛbiyai ve naati bɛ, niiti ti ʋalagai ma, <verse eid="1CO 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25"/>naa ɠa a kɛ, zeeɠaaɠwɛɛzu mina ɠɛ kpusɛi ʋa, kɛlɛ kpusɛi ʋaalobazuʋɛti pɛ ti yiizoolɛ ga ɓɔɠɔ, ti ɠilagilagi pɛ. <verse eid="1CO 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26"/>Ni kpusɛi ʋaalobazuʋɛ ta ɠa taɓai zu, zɔiti pɛ ta zoolɛzu ga ɓɔɠɔ ga tɔun maaʋele. Ni kpusɛi ʋaalobazuʋɛ gila ga lɛbiya zɔlɔɔna, zɔiti pɛ ta ɠoozunɛ ga tɔun maaʋele.<verse eid="1CO 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27"/>Wa ga Kilista ɓusɛi, wa ga baalobazuʋɛti, ɛsɛ pɛ ta tosu. <verse eid="1CO 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28"/>Niiti GALA ge ti zeiɗai Egilisii zu, mɔunpa keelaiti, ná velesiɛi GALA goo wo nuiti, ná zaʋasiɛi kalamɔinti, naa ʋolu, niiti ti laavɔɔ vaiti kɛɛzu, naa ʋolu, niiti seeɓɛ nu ɠɛdɛ fai ma zobogi ti ya, ta kpɔba wo nuiti, ta niiti ti losu zɔiti tuɠɔ, ta niiti ti ɓɔɛzu zii woo ɠiligiti su. <verse eid="1CO 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29"/>Ɛsɛ pɛ ka nɛi é ga keelai ɓaa? Ɛsɛ pɛ ka nɛi é ga GALA goo wo nui ɓaa? Ɛsɛ pɛ ka nɛi é ga kalamɔin ɓaa? Ɛsɛ pɛ ka nɛi a ɗa laavɔɔ vai ɠɛ ɓaa? <verse eid="1CO 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30"/>Ɛsɛ pɛ ka nɛi nu ɠɛdɛ vebɛanii zea ɓaa? Ɛsɛ pɛ ka nɛi a zoo zii woo ɠiligiti bosu ɓaa? Ɛsɛ pɛ ka nɛi a zoo daawooleʋegi wosu ɓaa? <verse eid="1CO 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31"/>Naa ɠa é ba, à vebɛani ɓii golaiti wɔin ɠɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">Nà ʋaazu pele ʋagɔi lɛɛzu ga woye naazu, nii fizɔgai gola.<verse eid="1CO 12:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13"/>
  <para style="s">Nɛɛbɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1"/>Anɛɛ ni nà ɓɔɛzu nuɓusɛiti ta geezuɠeelaiti daawooiti su, ni nɛɛbɛi la zìimaʋɛ, nà ɠɛ nɔ eɠɛ tala golai lugi, ɓaa kɔtɛgi lugi. <verse eid="1CO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2"/>Anɛɛ ni nà zoo gè GALA goo wo vebɛanii zɔlɔɔ, ta dɔɔɠuzu vaiti ma vaaɠaaɠaiti, ta faaɠwɛgi pɛ, anɛɛ kidaaleʋei pɛ ka zèa, eyɛsu gè ɗa gizeiti seɠe ti-losuʋɛti, ni nɛɛbɛi la zìimaʋɛ, gè la ga ani nɔpɛ. <verse eid="1CO 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3"/>Anɛɛ ni nà zèaɠɔligi pɛ gaaɠwɛɛzu, é ɠɛ ga bala nuiti kɔnɔgi, anɛɛ ɓalaa nà kpùsɛi veezu, é ɠala, ni nɛɛbɛi la zìimaʋɛ, naa la faa nɔpɛ paa mà.<verse eid="1CO 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4"/>Nɛɛbɛi yiilɔɔʋɛ, nɛɛbɛi ʋagɛ. É la toloi ɠɛa, é la ɓɔɠɔ vaa lɛa su, é la wasoga. <verse eid="1CO 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5"/>É la ɓaaɠulama vaa ɠɛa, é la tɔnɔ gaiziaa tɔ ɓɔɠɔ ɠila nɔ ʋɛ, zii la ɠulaa, é la faawanama makɛga. <verse eid="1CO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6"/>É la ɠoozunɛa telebotala vaa zu, kɛlɛ toɠa ɗa ɠoozunɛ gaamai zu. <verse eid="1CO 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7"/>Siɛʋɛ fai pɛ bu, é kidaaleʋei makɛgɛ fai pɛ su, kitogi ɠa bɛ fai pɛ su, fai pɛ kubogɛ su.<verse eid="1CO 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8"/>Nɛɛbɛi la ɓega eyɛsu ɠɔ. GALA goo wo fai ɠa ɓe yeeta, zii woo ɠili bo fai ma vebɛanii ɠa ɓe, faaɠwɛgi ɠa ɓe. <verse eid="1CO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9"/>Mazɔlɔɔ da-vaaɠwɛgi la laazeelini, ta GALA goo wo fai de kɛɛzu, daa la zeelini. <verse eid="1CO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10"/>Kɛlɛ siɛgi zu naa ʋaazu la, nii daazeeliai, daazeelilala gelei ɠa ɲɛɛlɛ niina.<verse eid="1CO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11"/>Siɛgi zu gè ɠɛni la ga doungoi, gè ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu eɠɛ doungoi, gè ɠɛni ɠisiɛzu, gè ɗa faiti kɛ eɠɛ doungoi, kɛlɛ bɔ̀ɔlɔai ma, gè ɠɛlɛni doungo vai pɛ ba. <verse eid="1CO 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12"/>Za ada wɛlɛzu ada zuɓidiai zu, eɠɛ da ɠɛ wɛlɛzu pɛtɛgi nɔ zu, kɛlɛ yeeɠɛɠala ɠa ʋaazu, ada ka ɠaazuni ta ɠaazu. Za tago nɔ ɠa gè kwɛɛ, kɛlɛ yeeɠɛɠala ɠa ʋaazu, nà kwɛɛ ga pagɔ, eɠɛʋelei GALA ge kwɛ̀ɛ la.<verse eid="1CO 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13"/>Naa ɠa é ba niizu, faa saʋagɔ ɠa é ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazu: kidaaleʋei, kitogi, nɛɛbɛi. Kɛlɛ zɔi bɔɔlɔai gola ti zaama, naa ɠa é ga nɛɛbɛi.<verse eid="1CO 13:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14"/>
  <para style="s">Vebɛaniiti sopelei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1"/>À ɠaaɓa ga wo nɛɛbɛi ziɛ. À Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ná-vebɛaniiti wɔin ɠɛ, ma un ge daa ma ga GALA goo wo fai. <verse eid="1CO 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2"/>Zɔi é ɓɔɛzu zii woo ɠiligiti su, naa la ɓɔɛzu nuɓusɛiti pɔ, kɛni GALA, mazɔlɔɔ nii é bosu, nu nɔpɛ ge la gaaɠaazu. Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ná-zobogi maaʋele ma, toɠa dɔɔɠuzu vaiti bosu. <verse eid="1CO 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3"/>Kɛlɛ zɔi é GALA gooi wosu, naa ɠa ɓɔɛzu nuɓusɛiti pɔ, é ti li luɠɔma kidaaleʋei zu, é ti iɲɔdɔɔ, é ti ɠaanɛɛnɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4"/>Zɔi é ɓɔɛzu zii woo ɠiligiti su, naa ɠa ɓɔɠɔ nɔ liizu luɠɔma kidaaleʋei zu, tama zɔi é GALA gooi wosu, naa ɠa Egilisii liizu luɠɔma kidaaleʋei zu. <verse eid="1CO 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5"/>Nà pɔ ga wo pɛ wo ɗa ɓɔɛ zii woo ɠiligiti su, kɛlɛ wɔ̀inʋɛ mɔnɔ gola ga wo zoo wo ɗa GALA gooi wo. Zɔi é GALA gooi wosu, naa wɔɔlɔʋɛ zɔi ʋa, é ɓɔɛzu zii woo ɠiligiti su, kɛni ni nu ɠa ná, a zoo daawooleʋesu, nii a kɛ Egilisii li luɠɔma kidaaleʋei zu.<verse eid="1CO 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, lee lɔnɔ ka wa sɔlɔɔ zèa, nà ʋaana wo ʋɔ bɛ, gè ɗa ɓɔɛ wo ʋɔ zii woo ɠiligiti su, ni gè la ɓɔɛni wo ʋɔ ga kulakɛlɛma vaiti, ɓaa faaɠwɛgi, ɓaa GALA gooi, ɓaa kalagi? <verse eid="1CO 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7"/>Gɛingɛin ganigiti pɛtɛ, eɠɛʋelei koolei la, ɓaa kɔnigi, ni gooi la ɠɛ zɔleni, ɗa gaaɠa ɠale ga nii ɠa koolei bosu, ɓaa kɔnigi bosu? <verse eid="1CO 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8"/>Ni puʋu fɛɛ wooi a zupuna, ɓɛ ɠa a ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ kɔɔɠɔ vai ma? <verse eid="1CO 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9"/>Zekana é la wa ɓalaagi. Ni wa ɓɔɛna zii woo ɠiligiti su, ga wooiti nu la ti ʋoluɠwɛɛ, ta naa ɠaaɠa ɠale? Wa ɓɔɛ fiilɛi nɔ zu. <verse eid="1CO 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10"/>Zii woo mɔinmɔin ka eteai zu. Ti zaama, gila kpalaa ge la ná nii é wosu, ni polu la ba. <verse eid="1CO 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11"/>Tama, ni gè la zii wooi naa ɠwɛɛ, nii ti ɓɔɛzu la pɔ̀, naama nui ɠɛa bɛ̀ ga wɛɛn, nà ɓalaa gè ɠɛa ga wɛɛn naama nui ʋɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12"/>Zekana é la wa ɓalaagi. Tɔɔzei wɔin ɠa wo ma gola ga wo Zɛnvui ná-vebɛaniiti sɔlɔɔ suwɔɔlɔ, ti ɠaiziɛ ungi ɠɛ wo ʋɛ ga Egilisii li luɠɔma kidaaleʋei zu.<verse eid="1CO 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13"/>Naa ɠa é ba, zɔi é ɓɔɛzu zii woo ɠiligi zu, é GALA fali ga é vebɛanii zɔlɔɔ, é zoo é daawooleʋe. <verse eid="1CO 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ni nà GALA falina zii wooi naa zu, nà GALA falizu ga zɛ̀nvui, kɛlɛ nà-kisiɛi zu ɲakai ʋe. <verse eid="1CO 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15"/>Leeni ɠa nà kɛ naazu? Nà GALA fali ga zɛ̀nvui, kɛlɛ nà GALA fali ɓalaa ga kìgi. Nà guyei loo ga zɛ̀nvui, kɛlɛ nà guyei loo ɓalaa ga kìgi. <verse eid="1CO 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16"/>Ni naa laade, ɗa GALA mamasu ga è-yɛnvui, zɔi é la niima vai ɠaaɠaani, naa ɠa zoo ɠale é ɓɔɛ bu ga: «Amina» ɗa-mama bogai naa zu? Tɔɔzei é la naa ɠwɛɛ, nii è bosu. <verse eid="1CO 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17"/>Anɛɛ ni ɗa-mama GALA falii ʋagɛ gola, é la ɓɔsu zɔi ʋa, é ʋa li luɠɔma kidaaleʋei zu.<verse eid="1CO 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18"/>Nà GALA mamasu, tɔɔzei nà zii woo ɠiligi wosu, gè leʋe wo pɛ ba. <verse eid="1CO 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19"/>Kɛlɛ Egilisi maaɓɔgi zu, zìima ɠa ga gè kpɔɛ lɔɔlugɔ nɔ wo, wooiti nu a ti ɠaaɠa, nii a kɛ zɔiti ti ɠi sɔlɔɔ, naa vizɔgɛ gè ʋa kpɔɛ waapuugɔ (10.000) wo zii woo ɠiligi zu.<verse eid="1CO 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, à mina ɠɛ ga doungoiti wa-ɠidafaawui ɠɛʋelei zu. À ɠɛ ga doungoiti faa ɲɔi letemazu, kɛlɛ à ɠɛ ga kpakologiti wa-ɠidafaawui letemazu. <verse eid="1CO 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21"/>Sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">«Zii ɠiligiti daawooi ta wɛɛinti daaʋɛ ɠa nà ɓɔɛ la niima nuɓusɛiti pɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">ti la vɔlɔ woiloga gòoi ma pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 14:21">Maliɠii wooi ɠana.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 28:11-12">Eza 28:11-12</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="1CO 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22"/>Zii woo ɠili bo fai ɠa mu ga poogi kidaaleʋelala nuiti bɛ, kɛlɛ kidaaleʋe nuiti taade. Kɛlɛ tɔun, GALA goo wo fai ɠa ga poogi kidaaleʋe nuiti bɛ, kɛlɛ kidaaleʋelala nuiti taade.<verse eid="1CO 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23"/>Ni tanisu, Egilisii pɛ ka ɠaalɛɛna ba, ti pɛ ti ɗa ɓɔɛ zii woo ɠiligiti su, ni niima vai ɠaaɠaalala nuiti ta ʋaana, ɓaa kidaaleʋelala nuiti, ti la ɠɛa ma wo litigɛ ɓaa? <verse eid="1CO 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24"/>Kɛlɛ ni ti pɛ ta GALA gooi wosu, kidaaleʋelala nui ta a ʋaana, ɓaa niima vai ɠaaɠaalala nui ta, ti pɛ ta-ɓɔɛi ɠa ná-kotoi ɠula kɛlɛma, é ɓɔɠɔ ɠwɛɛ ga sɔba nu, <verse eid="1CO 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25"/>ziimaʋɛ ma lɔɔɠuzu vaiti ta ɠula kɛlɛma. Toɠa unpilɛ zooi ma, é nɔkɔ GALA bu, é bo ga: «Gaamazu, GALA ka wo zaama!»<verse eid="1CO 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Egilisii zu vaazeikpasui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, leeni ɠa maanɛai é ɠɛ deɠɛmu? Siɛgi zu wo maaɓɔsu da, ta ɠa ná guye looi veai zea, ta ɠa ná kalagi wo fai veai zea, ta ɠa ná kulakɛlɛmai vai veai zea, ta ɠa ná zii woo ɠiligi wo fai veai zea, ta ɠa ná a zoo é daawooleʋe, naa pɛ ge ɠɛ ga zaɓui é ɓɔ Egilisii ʋa, é li luɠɔma kidaaleʋei zu. <verse eid="1CO 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27"/>Ni nui ta a ɠɛɛna é ɓɔɛ zii woo ɠiligi zu, nu felegɔ ɓaa nu saʋagɔ ta laa ʋa naa ma ga seizu saʋagɔ, kɛlɛ ti kula bu ga gilagila. Kɛlɛ kɛni nu ɠɛ ná, é ɗa ti laawooleʋe. <verse eid="1CO 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28"/>Ni daawooleʋe nu la ná, ti maaɠɛ kpɔ Egilisii zu, ti ɗa ɓɔɛ yiimaʋɛ GALA pɔ. <verse eid="1CO 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29"/>GALA goo wo nuiti tetema, nu felegɔ ɓaa saʋagɔ nɔ kpɔɛi wo, nii ti bosu, zɔiti ti ɗa ɠida naa wu. <verse eid="1CO 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30"/>Kɛlɛ ni GALA ga fai ta ɠulana zɔi ʋɛ kɛlɛma, ma mɔungi maaɠɛ kpɔ. <verse eid="1CO 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31"/>Mazɔlɔɔ wo pɛ wa zoo wo GALA gooi wo, ni wa seɠena da ga gilagila, naa ɠa a kɛ ɛsɛ pɛ ge faa maalɛlɛ, ɛsɛ pɛ iɲɔ ge lɔ kidaaleʋei zu. <verse eid="1CO 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32"/>Zɔiti ti GALA gooi wosu, ta ɗa dama ga vebɛanii feai ti ya, <verse eid="1CO 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33"/>mazɔlɔɔ GALA ge la ga faazupu ƓALAGI, kɛni ziilɛi GALAGI.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Eɠɛʋelei é la GALA ná-Egilisiiti pɛ su ná-nuiti saama, <verse eid="1CO 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34"/>kɛni anzanuiti ti ɗa maaɠɛ kpɔ, Egilisi maaɓɔgiti su, mazɔlɔɔ é la veeni ti ʋɛ ga ti ʋa ɗa kpɔɛi zuɠula ná, kɛlɛ kɛni ti ɓɔɠɔmaayei, eɠɛʋelei tɔgi bogai la. <verse eid="1CO 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35"/>Ni ta pɔ ga ti fai ta zuɠɛzɛ zo, kɛni ti ti-zinigiti gaazaɠa pɛlɛi wu. Mazɔlɔɔ é la zolooni anzanui ma ga é ʋa ɓɔɛ Egilisi maaɓɔgi zu.<verse eid="1CO 14:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36"/>Toɠa ɠale, wo ʋɔ bɛ ɠa GALA daawooi zeɠeai ná ɓaa? Ɓaa mu wa ɠila nɔ ɠa seeliai wo ma? <verse eid="1CO 14:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37"/>Ni nui ta ɠa ɠisiɛzu ga toɠa ga GALA goo wo nu, ɓaa GALA Zɛnvui ma vebɛani veeʋɛ bɛ, kɛni é kwɛɛ ga niiti gè ti zɛʋɛai, gè ti leʋe wo ma, ta ga Maliɠii ná-deveiti. <verse eid="1CO 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38"/>Ni nu a ɠɛlɛna ti ɠwɛɛ fai ʋa, tɔ ɓalaagi é la ɠwɛɛga.<verse eid="1CO 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39"/>Naa ɠa é ba, kɛ̀ɛleaiti, à GALA goo wo vebɛanii wɔin ɠɛ, kɛlɛ à mina pele leʋe zii woo ɠiligiti bo fai luɠɔ. <verse eid="1CO 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40"/>Kɛlɛ kɛni fai pɛ ge ɠɛ gaaɠula ba ga pagɔ.<verse eid="1CO 14:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu Kilista wuzeɠe vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, nà wo ɠitoozu Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi zu, nii gè daazeelini wo ma, wo yeezeini bu, tɔ ɠa wa-ɠidaaleʋei ɠiliai ba kpaan, <verse eid="1CO 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2"/>tɔ ɠa wo ɠizogai saalai zu ɓalaa, ni wo sogɛ ga ʋelei nɔ gè daazeelini la wo ma. Ni naa laade, wa ɠidaaleʋe wafuun nɔ.<verse eid="1CO 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3"/>Gè wo ɠalani ga faa ɓii mɔunpagi ga ʋelei gè sɔlɔɔni la ɓalaa: Kilista zaani ada-ɠotoiti faa zu, eɠɛʋelei GALA Sɛʋɛi bosu la, <verse eid="1CO 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4"/>maaɠuluni, buzeɠeʋɛ, é ɠula saai ya foloi zaʋasiɛi ma, eɠɛʋelei GALA Sɛʋɛi bosu la, <verse eid="1CO 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5"/>é ɠulani kɛlɛma Piyɛlɛ ʋɛ, naa ʋolu keela puugɔ maazu felegɔiti (12) bɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6"/>Naa ʋoluma, kidaaleʋe nuiti é ɠulani kɛlɛma ti ʋɛ ʋɔɔma, ti-liegi leʋeni nu undɔɔlugɔ (500) ʋa. Naati ma mɔinmɔin ka dɛ vulua, tanigaani nɔ ɠa dɛ ti zaai. <verse eid="1CO 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7"/>Naa ʋoluma, é ɠulani kɛlɛma Zake ʋɛ, naa ʋolu keelaiti pɛ.<verse eid="1CO 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8"/>Ti pɛ poluma, é ɠulani nà ɓalaa bɛ̀ kɛlɛma, nɛ̀i kɛ̀ai eɠɛ doin saai pɛ dee ɠoozu, é ʋa zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="1CO 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9"/>Mazɔlɔɔ dɔ̀iʋɛ keelaiti su, gaamazu màa la nɛɛni gè ʋa loli ga keela, tɔɔzei gè GALA ná-Egilisii wɔinzeɠeni. <verse eid="1CO 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10"/>Kɛlɛ GALA ná-zaalai maaʋele ma, ʋelei gè la, nà ga naa. Ná-zaalai é daa mà, naa la ɠɛni ga wafuun faa. Naa li poun, tɔun gè botii ɠɛɛʋɛ é leʋe ti pɛ ba, tama nà ɓɔɠɔ laade, kɛlɛ GALA ná-zaalai ʋe, é nɔ̀un ba. <verse eid="1CO 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11"/>Naa ɠa é ba, é ɠɛni ga nà ʋe-o, ɓaa tiya ʋe-o, zekana gi tɛnɛgi wosu da, ze ma kana wo ɠidaaleʋeni la.<verse eid="1CO 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gɔvɛiti buzeɠe vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12"/>Tɛi gi tɛnɛgi wosu ga Kilista wuzeɠeni, é ɠula saai ya, leeni vaa zu wo zaama, tanigaani ti ɠɛɛzu ma, gɔvɛiti ti la wuzeɠea, ti ʋa ɠula saai ya? <verse eid="1CO 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13"/>Ni gɔvɛiti ti la wuzeɠea, ti ʋa ɠula saai ya, deɠɛmu Kilista ɓalaagi la ɠɛni wuzeɠeni, é ɠula saai ya. <verse eid="1CO 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14"/>Tama ni Kilista la ɠɛni wuzeɠeni, é ʋa ɠula saai ya, naazu tɛnɛgi gi bosu, é ɠɛa ga faa ɲaka, wa ɓalaagi wa-ɠidaaleʋei ɠɛa ga faa ɲaka. <verse eid="1CO 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15"/>Tama, ni gaama ʋe ga gɔvɛiti ti la wuzeɠea, ti ʋa ɠula saai ya, gi maanɛɛʋɛ gi leve ga zɛɛ zeeleiti GALA tetema. Tɔɔzei gi ma zeele wooi woni ga GALA ge Kilista wuzeɠeni, é kula saai ya. Kɛlɛ ni é la ɠɛni naa ɠɛɛni, ni gaama ʋe gɔvɛiti ti la wuzeɠea, ti ʋa ɠula saai ya. <verse eid="1CO 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16"/>Ni gɔvɛiti ti la wuzeɠea, ti ʋa ɠula saai ya, Kilista la ɠɛni wuzeɠeni mu, é ʋa ɠula saai ya. <verse eid="1CO 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17"/>Ni Kilista la ɠɛni wuzeɠeni, é ʋa ɠula saai ya, wa-ɠidaaleʋei ɠɛa ga faa ɲaka, wa dɛ wa-ɠotoiti su. <verse eid="1CO 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18"/>Naazu ma, niiti ti ɠidaaleʋeai yɛgai dɛ Kilista ma eyɛsu ti za, naati ti undaaʋiliga. <verse eid="1CO 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19"/>Ni niima eteai zu vaa nɔ ɠa, ade ɠitogai da Kilista ʋa, ade maawɔinʋɛ, é leʋe nuɓusɛiti pɛ ba.<verse eid="1CO 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20"/>Kɛlɛ gaamazu, Kilista wuzeɠeni, é ɠula saai ya, naa ɠa é kitogi veezu la ga niiti ti zaai, ta wuzeɠe ɓalaa, ti ɠula saai ya. <verse eid="1CO 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21"/>Mazɔlɔɔ eɠɛʋelei saai ʋaai la ga nu ɠilagi maaʋele, zenɔ ɠana, gɔvɛiti buzeɠe vai ɓalaa ʋaai la ga nu ɠilagi maaʋele. <verse eid="1CO 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22"/>Mazɔlɔɔ eɠɛʋelei ɛsɛ pɛ ge saai maazɔlɔɔsu da ga Adama maaʋele, zekana nɔ ɛsɛ pɛ ka zɛnvui wo da ʋolu ɓalaa ga Kilista maaʋele. <verse eid="1CO 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23"/>Kɛlɛ ɛsɛ pɛ ta tosu, Kilista ɠa é ga ti pɛ ma mɔungi, naa ʋoluma niiti ti ga Kilista nɔnɔiti, siɛgi zu é ʋaazu la. <verse eid="1CO 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24"/>Naa ʋoluma gaaɓela foloi ɠa zeeli niina, Kilista a masadai veena Ɠɛɛɠɛ GALA zea, naazu é ɓega ga masadaiti pɛ koloɠolo, ta zobodaiti, ta zɛbɛiti. <verse eid="1CO 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25"/>Mazɔlɔɔ kɛni Kilista masadai ɠɛ, eyɛsu GALA ge sili nuiti pɛ puu kɔɠɔwu. <verse eid="1CO 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26"/>Sili nui ma ɠaaɓelagi a koloɠolo, naa ɠa é ga saai. <verse eid="1CO 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27"/>Sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga: «GALA ge aniiti pɛ puu kɔɠɔwu.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 8:7">Guy 8:7</ref></char>.</char></note> Kɛlɛ wooi nii é wosu ga «aniiti pɛ», koleʋɛ ga GALA ge la «anii pɛgi» naa zu, tɛigi é aniiti pɛ kolozu Kilista ʋɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28"/>Siɛgi zu aniiti pɛ ti ɠolozu la Kilista ʋɛ, naazu tɔ ɓɔɠɔi, Doun Zunui, toɠa unmaayei GALA bɛ, nii é anii pɛ koloai bɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ GALA ge ɠɛ ga ma ɓiigi fai pɛ su.<verse eid="1CO 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29"/>À ɠisiɛ lɛɛ mɔnɔ naati ta-vai zu, niiti ti ɓatizesu gɔvɛiti bɛ. Leeni ɠa ti ɠitogai ba ga ti sɔlɔɔ? Ni gaama ʋe ga gɔvɛiti ti la wuzeɠea, ti ɠula saai ya, lee vaa zu naati ti ɓatizesu gɔvɛiti bɛ? <verse eid="1CO 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30"/>Giya ma, leeni vaa zu gi faaɓaagi laawu lɛlɛi pɛ daawu? <verse eid="1CO 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31"/>Folo-o-folo nà saai laawu, nà bosu wo ma ga ɠite, kɛ̀ɛleaiti, naama wasogi maaʋele ma, nii é zèa wa-vaa ma, da-ɠilibalai zu da de-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista. <verse eid="1CO 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32"/>Ni nuɓusɛiti gaazu vai nɔ ɠa gè dɔɓɔ zuaiti sakpeni la Efɛze, nà-tɔnɔgi ɠa naa zu ga leeni? Ni gɔvɛiti ti la wuzeɠezu, ti ʋa ɠula saai ya, «Ade daamii wo, de ɓɔɔle, mazɔlɔɔ da zaazu lina.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 22:13">Eza 22:13</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="1CO 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33"/>À mina ɓɔɠɔ yaava: «Bɔɔla ɲɔiti ta ɗa nu zɔ pagɔiti koloɠolo.» <verse eid="1CO 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34"/>À ɠale ma ʋolu wo ɠɛʋele ʋagɔi ma, ʋelei soloogai la. À ɓe koto ɠɛɛ vai ʋa. Mazɔlɔɔ tanigaani ta wo zaama, ti la GALA kwɛɛ. Nà naa wosu wo unfe fai ma.<verse eid="1CO 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kpusɛi buzeɠeai, é ɠula saai ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35"/>Kɛlɛ nui ta ɠa ɠɛ ma: «Gɔvɛiti ta wuzeɠe ɠale, ti ɠula saai ya? Kpusɛ ɓɛgele ɠa ti ʋaazu sɔlɔɔsu?» <verse eid="1CO 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36"/>Ɠimalala nu ɠa ga ɗe! Ani ɠaei è dɔɔzu zooi wu, é la zɛnvui woga ʋolu, kɛni a zaana. <verse eid="1CO 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37"/>Nii è siinsu, naama ziinziin ganigi ɠɔlɔgi laade, é ʋa ɠɛ ʋɔnɔsu, kɛni ma ɠɛzɛi, é ɠɛni ga moloi, ɓaa ani zuwu ɠiligi tanɔpɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38"/>GALA ka kɔlɔgi veezu ma ɠaei ya, eɠɛʋelei é pɔ la, ma ɠaei ɠilagilagi pɛ ka ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔlɔgi zɔlɔɔsu, eɠɛʋelei GALA ge pɔ la. <verse eid="1CO 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39"/>Kpɛtɛaniiti kpusɛi la ga ani ɠila, nuɓusɛi nɔnɔi ɠa ná, suaiti tɔnɔi ɠɛ ná, wɔniiti tɔnɔi ɠɛ ná, kaleiti tɔnɔi ɠɛ ná. <verse eid="1CO 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40"/>Geezu aniiti kɔlɔgiti ta ná, zooi ma aniiti kɔlɔgiti ti ɠɛ ná. Geezu geleiti kɔlɔgi ná-pagi ɠa yɛ, zou ma aniiti kɔlɔgi ná-pagi ɠɛ yɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41"/>Foloi ná-pagi ɠa yɛ, alugi ná-pagi ɠɛ yɛ, somideɠaiti ta-ʋagi ɠɛ yɛ, somideɠaiti folo ʋeleiti ti la ɓɔni, anɛɛ somideɠai ta ɠa volozu é leʋe ta ʋa.<verse eid="1CO 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42"/>Zekana é ɠɛɛzu la gɔvɛiti ta wuzeɠena, ti ɠula saai ya. Siɛgi zu kpusɛi zaazu la, é la zooi wu, é luula. A wuzeɠena, é ɠula saai ya, toɠa niina ga saalala gelei. <verse eid="1CO 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43"/>A ɠɛna laa zooi wu, maawɔinʋɛ, zɛbɛ la ba. A wuzeɠena, é ɠula saai ya, pagai, zɛbɛi ba. <verse eid="1CO 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44"/>Siɛgi zu é lɔɔzu la zooi wu, toɠa ga kpusɛ ɠɔlɔgi. Siɛgi zu é wuzeɠezu la, é ɠula saai ya, GALA Zɛnvui ɠa a ɠɛ su. Ʋelei kpusɛ ɠɔlɔgi naa la, ʋele ɠana ɓalaa kpusɛi naa la Zɛnvui su. <verse eid="1CO 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45"/>Naa ɠa é ba, sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga: «Zunu mɔungi Adama ɠɛɛni ga zɛnvu su nu.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Zen 2:7</ref></char>.</char></note> Kɛlɛ Adama ma ɠaaɓelagi ɠa ga zɛnvui, nii é zɛnvui veezu. <verse eid="1CO 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46"/>Nii é ga zɛnvu zu gelei, naa ese taade é ʋa ʋa, kɛni kpusɛ zu gelei, naa ʋoluma, zɛnvu zu gelei ʋa leɠa ʋa. <verse eid="1CO 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47"/>Zunu mɔungi ɓɛtɛni ga zooi ma ʋɔlɔi, zooi nɔnɔi ɠana. Zunui velesiɛi naa ʋaani, é zeɠe geezuʋɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48"/>Zɔiti ti ga zooi nɔnɔiti, naati kulaʋɛ ga zɔi nii é ɓɛtɛni ga zooi ma ʋɔlɔi. Zɔiti ti ga geezu geleiti, naati kulaʋɛ ga zɔi, nii é ʋaani, é zeɠe geezuʋɛ. <verse eid="1CO 15:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49"/>Eɠɛʋelei de ɠulaa la ga zunui é ɓɛtɛni ga zooi ma ʋɔlɔi, zenɔ ɠana da ɠula la ga zɔi paai, é zeɠe geezuʋɛ.<verse eid="1CO 15:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, à wɛlɛ nii gè pɔ gè bo, toɠa ga: Nii kpɛtɛai ga kpusɛi ta ɲamai, naa la zooga é ʋa nɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ GALA ná-masadai zu. Zɔi ma é ga duula gelei, naa la zooga é ʋa duulalala gelei zɔlɔɔ.<verse eid="1CO 15:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51"/>À wɛlɛ, nà dɔɔɠuzu vaa wosu wo ma: Ade pɛ de la zaa, kɛlɛ ade pɛ da valibo, <verse eid="1CO 15:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52"/>yeeɠɛɠala go nɔ laawu, gaazulooma laa ɠila daawu, siɛgi zu puʋu gaaɓelagi vɛɛzu la. Mazɔlɔɔ siɛgi zu é vɛɛzu la, gɔvɛiti ta wuzeɠe, ti ɠula saai ya, ga duulalala ɓusɛi. Ada ma, ade pɛ da valibo. <verse eid="1CO 15:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53"/>Mazɔlɔɔ kɛni duula ɓusɛi duulalala gelei loo ɠɔba, saa ɓusɛi nii saalala gelei loo ɠɔba. <verse eid="1CO 15:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54"/>Siɛgi zu duula ɓusɛi nii a duulalala gelei loona la ɠɔba, saa ɓusɛi nii a saalala gelei loona la ɠɔba, naama wooi laa ɠa zeeli niina, nii sɛʋɛai ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:54">«Zobogi zɔlɔɔga mɛtu saai ma!»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">Eza 25:8</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="1CO 15:54"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55"/>«Ee, saai, ɗa-zobogi ɠa mini?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CO 15:55">Ee, saai, è-ma lologi ɠa mini?»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 13:14">Woz 13:14</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note><verse eid="1CO 15:55"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56"/>Saai ma lologi ɠa é ga kotoi, kotoi ná-zɛbɛi ɠa é ga tɔgi. <verse eid="1CO 15:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57"/>Kɛlɛ mamagi ɠa GALA bɛ, é zobogi veezu ade ya, ga de-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista maaʋele!<verse eid="1CO 15:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58"/>Naa ɠa é ba, kɛ̀ɛleaiti, nɛ̀ɛɲɔɠɔiti, à lo kpaan, wo mina ɲiikpi, à li luɠɔma Maliɠii ná-botii zu, wo ɠɛ suɠwɛɛ ga wo-mɔɔlɛzuʋɛ la ɠɛa ga wafuun Maliɠii ya.<verse eid="1CO 15:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16"/>
  <para style="s">Zeeɓɔ fai Zeluzalɛme Egilisii vaa ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1"/>Nii é ga zeemaaɓɔgi ma vaa, é lo kidaaleʋe nuiti ba ti Zeluzalɛme, à kɛ eɠɛʋelei nɔ gè Egilisiiti kalagai da Galate yooi zu. <verse eid="1CO 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2"/>Dɔɔɠɔi ma volo mɔungi ɠilagilagi pɛ, wo ɠilagilagi pɛ ge ani la ɠoba yɛ, nii a zoo da, eɠɛʋelei ná-zobogi la. À mina pàa yeei maaɓɔun, ga wo ʋa yeemaaɓɔ. <verse eid="1CO 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3"/>Siɛgi zu nà ʋaana la, naama nuiti wa yeelo ti ʋa, ná ti leʋe, ti ɠalivaa zɛʋɛi ti ya, ti li ga wa-ɓɔba anii Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="1CO 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4"/>Ni nà ɓɔɠɔi kɛni gè li ɓalaa, gá siɛi wo niina gá tiye.<verse eid="1CO 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ná-siɛ wo fai ma levei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5"/>Nà leʋena Masedoane yooi zu, nà ʋa niina wo ʋɔ bɛ, mazɔlɔɔ nà leʋesu ga naama yooi zu ʋele. <verse eid="1CO 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6"/>Tanisu nà ku felegɔ ɠɛɛzu wo ʋɔ bɛ, ɓaa gè samai ɠɛ wo ʋa, naa ɠa a kɛ wo ɗa màazaa, ʋɛti nà ɠɛ liizu náti. <verse eid="1CO 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7"/>Gè la pɔ ga gè ʋa wo ɠaa, gè ʋa leʋe nɔ, kɛlɛ toɠa kìsu ga gè yeeɠɛɠalai ta ɠɛ wo ʋɔ bɛ, ni Maliɠii a laana ga.<verse eid="1CO 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8"/>Kɛlɛ tama nà ɠɛɛzu gè yɛ Efɛze eyɛsu Pantekote voloi zeeli. <verse eid="1CO 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9"/>Mazɔlɔɔ botii ɠɛ zobo pagɔi ma ʋɛlɛla wolai laalaogɛ tùɠɔ, anɛɛ ni sàkpe nuiti mɔinʋɛ.<verse eid="1CO 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10"/>Ni Timɔte a ʋaana, à kɛ wo dɛɛ ga wo yeezeiʋɛ bu ga pagɔ wo zaama, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa botii ɠɛɛzu ga nɔ̀un kɛʋele, Maliɠii ná-botii zu. <verse eid="1CO 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11"/>Naa ɠa é ba, nu nɔpɛ ge mina bɛlɛʋili. À maazaa, é ná-siɛi wo ga pagɔ, é zoo é zeeli mà ziilɛigi zu, mazɔlɔɔ nà-o, ade-ɠɛɛleaiti-yo, gá maaɓɔunsu.<verse eid="1CO 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12"/>Nii é ga ade-ɠɛɛloin Apolɔse nɔnɔi, gè maanɛɛnɛni gola, ga ta ade-ɠɛɛleai zɔiti ti ʋa wo ʋɔ bɛ, kɛlɛ é la ɠɛni leveni ga ziimai niizu é ʋa kɛ. Kɛlɛ tama toɠa liizu, siɛgi zu a ná zɔlɔɔna da.<verse eid="1CO 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fali ɠaaɓelagiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13"/>À wɛlɛ ɓɔɠɔ ma, wo lo kpaan kidaaleʋei zu, wo zɛbɛzeɠe, wo yiilɔɔ. <verse eid="1CO 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14"/>Nii kpein wo kɛɛzu, à ti pɛ kɛ ga nɛɛbɛi.<verse eid="1CO 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, wo Setefanase ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ɠwɛɛ, Akayi yooi zu, tiya ɠa ti ɠɛni ga ma mɔungi, ti ɠidaaleʋe, ti ɓɔɠɔ lɔ GALA ná-nuiti maavaa ɠɛɛ vai zu. Nà wo maanɛɛnɛzu ga <verse eid="1CO 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16"/>wo ɠolo naa ɠɛɠala nuiti bɛ, ta naati pɛ, niiti ti botii ɠɛɛzu ʋɔɔma ta tiye.<verse eid="1CO 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17"/>Kòozunɛɛʋɛ Setefanaseni paa vai zu ta Fɔɔletunatuse, ta Akayikuse. Nii gè ʋalani ma wo ʋoluʋelei, ti naa laazeelini. <verse eid="1CO 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ti zìilɛini, ti wa ɓalaa wo yiilɛi. À unfema ve naa ɠɛɠala nuiti bɛ.<verse eid="1CO 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tuʋɔ gooiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19"/>Azi yooi zu Egilisiiti ta wo luʋɔsu. Akilase ta Pilisile, é ɓɔ Egilisii ʋa é gaalɛbai wosu ta-ʋɛlɛi wu, naati ɓalaa ta ta-luʋɔ gooi laazeelizu wo ma, Maliɠii laaseigi zu. <verse eid="1CO 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20"/>Ade-ɠɛɛleaiti pɛ ta wo luʋɔsu. À ɓɔɠɔ luʋɔ ga nɛɛnɛi.<verse eid="1CO 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21"/>Nà Pɔle, nà ɓɔɠɔi zèeʋogi ɠa gè wo luʋɔsu da.<verse eid="1CO 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22"/>Ni nui ta la Maliɠii nɛɛni ʋɛ, kotoʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:22">Malanata (ʋaana, gi-Maliɠii)!<verse eid="1CO 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23"/>Maliɠii Yesu ná-zaalai yɛ wo ʋa. <verse eid="1CO 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24"/>Nà-nɛɛbɛi ɠa wo pɛ wo ʋa, ada-ɠilibalai zu da Yesu Kilista.<verse eid="1CO 16:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16"/>
</usx>
